ng lamp illuminates and airbag deployment may be impaired in a crash event.",[["h","Clock spring (spiral cable) damaged in steering column"],["m","Loose or corroded airbag connector under steering wheel"],["l","SRS control module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"B0002":["Driver Frontal Stage 2 Deployment Control","The SRS module has detected a fault in the deployment control circuit for the second stage of the driver frontal airbag. Dual-stage airbags use two charges for severity-dependent deployment — this code indicates the high-severity stage cannot be triggered reliably.",[["h","Clock spring damaged or worn"],["m","Stage 2 squib circuit open or shorted"],["l","SRS control module fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"B0003":["Driver Frontal Deployment Loop Resistance Low","The SRS module has detected that the resistance in the driver frontal airbag deployment loop is below the expected range, suggesting a short or partial short between the squib leads. The airbag warning lamp is illuminated.",[["h","Shorted squib leads in clock spring or wiring"],["m","Internal short within driver airbag module"],["m","Connector corrosion bridging pins"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1200]],"c"],"B0004":["Driver Frontal Deployment Loop Resistance High","The SRS module measured a higher than expected resistance in the driver frontal airbag deployment circuit. Causes include a partially open connection, corroded contacts, or a damaged clock spring conductor.",[["h","Clock spring conductor partially worn"],["m","Oxidized airbag connector pins"],["l","Driver airbag module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[150,1000]],"c"],"B0006":["Driver Frontal Deployment Loop Short to Ground","One of the deployment leads for the driver frontal airbag is shorted to ground. The SRS module disables deployment of the affected stage to prevent unintended firing.",[["h","Chafed wiring contacting metal"],["m","Water intrusion at connector"],["l","Internal airbag module short to housing"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[150,1000]],"l"],"B0007":["Driver Frontal Deployment Loop Short to Battery","The driver frontal airbag deployment loop is shorted to battery voltage. This is potentially dangerous as it could cause unintended deployment; the SRS module isolates the circuit and sets the warning lamp.",[["h","Wiring shorted to powered conductor"],["m","Damaged connector bridging power"],["l","SRS module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1200]],"l"],"B0010":["Right Front/Passenger Frontal Deployment Control","Right Front/Passenger Frontal Deployment Control: the restraints module has detected a fault in this airbag/pretensioner deployment circuit, which may prevent correct deployment in a crash. Safety-critical.",[["h","Loose or corroded passenger airbag connector"],["m","Squib circuit open or shorted"],["l","SRS control module fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"B0011":["Right Front/Passenger Frontal Stage 2 Deployment Control","Right Front/Passenger Frontal Stage 2 Deployment Control: the restraints module has detected a fault in this airbag/pretensioner deployment circuit, which may prevent correct deployment in a crash. Safety-critical.",[["h","Stage 2 squib circuit open or shorted"],["m","Loose or corroded airbag connector"],["l","SRS control module fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety functio