 rotation in the door lock and is used for keyless functions and the alarm system.",[["h","Lock cylinder switch failed"],["m","Door harness broken in door hinge area"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,300]],"l"],"B0101":["Front Crash Sensor Circuit Malfunction","A fault has been detected in the front crash sensor circuit, used to detect frontal impacts and trigger airbags/pretensioners.",[["h","Sensor damaged after minor impact"],["m","Corroded sensor connector behind bumper"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[150,600]],"l"],"B0102":["Power Mirror Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the power mirror switch circuit. The switch input does not match a valid pattern — mirror adjustment may be inoperative.",[["h","Mirror switch failed"],["m","Wiring or connector open"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0103":["Front Crash Sensor Left Communication Lost","Communication with the left front crash sensor has been lost; SRS deployment logic for frontal impacts is degraded.",[["h","Open bus wiring"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[120,600]],"l"],"B0104":["Driver Mirror Adjust Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver-side mirror adjust switch circuit. The mirror cannot be moved via the switch on the driver door.",[["h","Driver mirror switch failed"],["m","Wiring open or shorted"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0105":["Front Crash Sensor Right Communication Lost","Communication with the right fron