or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0127":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet \"A\" Circuit/Open","Open circuit on the high-voltage power outlet \"A\" of DC/AC converter A. The outlet supplies 110/230 V AC from the HV battery on EVs/hybrids (vehicle-to-load).",[["h","Outlet wiring open"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"],["l","Cracked solder joint inside the module or sensor"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,2000]],"l"],"B0128":["Passenger Occupant Detection System Malfunction","The passenger occupant detection system (ODS), used to enable/disable the passenger airbag based on weight, has reported a malfunction.",[["h","Seat sensor mat failure"],["m","ODS calibration lost after seat work"],["m","Loose ODS connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1200]],"l"],"B0129":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet \"C\" Circuit/Open","Open circuit on the high-voltage power outlet \"C\" of DC/AC converter A.",[["h","Outlet wiring open"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"],["l","Cracked solder joint inside the module or sensor"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,2000]],"l"],"B012A":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet \"D\" Circuit/Open","Open circuit on the high-voltage power outlet \"D\" of DC/AC converter A.",[["h","Outlet wiring open"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"],["l","Cracked solder joint inside the module or sensor"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,2000]],"l"],"B012B":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet \"E\" Circuit/Open","Open circuit on the high-voltage power outlet \"E\" of DC/AC converter A.",[["h","Outlet wiring open"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"],["l","Cracked solder joint inside the module or sensor"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,2000]],"l"],"B012C":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet Control Module \"A\"","Fault reported by control module \"A\" of the high-voltage power outlet on DC/AC converter A.",[["h","Module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[300,2500]],"l"],"B012D":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet Control Module \"B\"","Fault reported by control module \"B\".",[["h","Module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[300,2500]],"l"],"B012E":["DC/AC Converter A High Voltage Power Outlet Control Module \"C\"","Fault reported by control module \"C\".",[["h","Module internal fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[300,2500]],"l"],"B012F":["A/V Sensor Washer Fluid A Control Circuit","Fault on the control circuit of the audio/video sensor washer fluid pump A. Sprays cleaning fluid on ADAS audio/video sensor lenses.",[["h","Washer fluid pump failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0130":["Driver Seatbelt Tension Sensor Circuit","The driver seatbelt tension sensor circuit is faulty. This sensor is used by the SRS to adjust deployment based on belt usage.",[["h","Tension sensor fault"],["m","Corroded sensor connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[120,500]],"l"],"B0131":["A/V Sensor Washer Fluid C Control Circuit","Fault on the audio/video sensor washer fluid pump C control circuit.",[["h","Washer fluid pump failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0132":["A/V Sensor Washer Fluid D Control Circuit","Fault on the A/V sensor washer fluid pump D control circuit.",[["h","Washer fluid pump failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0133":["A/V Sensor Washer Fluid E Control Circuit","Fault on the A/V sensor washer fluid pump E control circuit.",[["h","Washer fluid pump failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0134":["A/V Sensor Washer Fluid F Control Circuit","Fault on the A/V sensor washer fluid pump F control circuit.",[["h","Washer fluid pump failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0140":["Passenger Seatbelt Tension Sensor Circuit","The passenger seatbelt tension sensor circuit is faulty.",[["h","Tension sensor fault"],["m","Loose sensor connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[120,500]],"l"],"B0150":["HVAC Mode Door Range/Performance","The HVAC control module has detected that the air distribution mode door (e.g. floor/face/defrost) does not reach the commanded position within the expected time.",[["h","Mode door actuator motor failed"],["m","Mode door mechanically binding"],["l","Wiring or connector fault to actuator"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,600]],"l"],"B0152":["Driver Buckle Switch Circuit Malfunction","The driver seatbelt buckle switch circuit, used to detect whether the belt is fastened, is malfunctioning. The seatbelt warning may be permanently on or off.",[["h","Buckle switch worn or stuck"],["m","Wire break under seat"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,350]],"l"],"B0154":["Passenger Buckle Switch Circuit Malfunction","The passenger seatbelt buckle switch circuit is malfunctioning.",[["h","Buckle switch failure"],["m","Corroded buckle connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,350]],"l"],"B0156":["Sun Load Sensor Circuit","The HVAC control module has detected an implausible signal from the sun load (solar) sensor, typically located on the dashboard. Automatic climate control uses this signal to bias cooling on the side facing the sun.",[["h","Sun load sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0158":["Ambient Air Temperature Sensor Circuit","The HVAC control module has detected an implausible signal from the ambient air temperature sensor used by the climate control system. Symptoms include incorrect outside temperature display and erratic automatic climate behavior.",[["h","Ambient air temperature sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,150]],"l"],"B0159":["Outside Temperature Sensor Range/Performance","The HVAC control module reports an out-of-range or implausible reading from the outside air temperature sensor. The displayed value may be stuck or impossibly high/low.",[["h","Outside temperature sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"],["l","Sensor element aged beyond calibration window"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,150]],"l"],"B0160":["In-Vehicle Temperature Sensor Circuit","The HVAC control module has detected an implausible signal from the in-vehicle temperature sensor — typically an aspirated sensor in the dashboard. Automatic climate control regulates cabin temperature using this signal.",[["h","In-vehicle temperature sensor failed"],["m","Aspirator fan or duct blocked"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,300]],"l"],"B0162":["Sun Load Sensor 2 Circuit","The HVAC control module has detected an implausible signal from the second sun load sensor. Dual-zone systems use two solar sensors to detect side-asymmetric sunlight and adjust left/right airflow temperature.",[["h","Sun load sensor 2 failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0164":["Air Bag In-Vehicle Temperature Sensor Circuit","A fault is detected in the in-vehicle temperature sensor circuit used by the SRS module for deployment compensation.",[["h","Temperature sensor failure"],["m","Wiring short or open"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,300]],"l"],"B0166":["HVAC Discharge Air Temperature Sensor","The HVAC control module reports an implausible signal from the discharge (vent outlet) air temperature sensor. This sensor verifies that the actual outlet air temperature matches the commanded value.",[["h","Discharge air temp sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,300]],"l"],"B0168":["HVAC Air Mix Door Performance","The HVAC control module has detected that the air mix (blend) door does not reach the commanded position within the expected time. The blend door regulates the ratio of air through the heater core versus around it.",[["h","Blend door actuator motor failed"],["m","Blend door mechanically binding or broken"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,800]],"l"],"B0170":["HVAC Mode Door Position Sensor","The HVAC control module reports an implausible position signal from the mode (air distribution) door feedback sensor. Without valid feedback the actuator cannot be regulated to the correct position.",[["h","Mode door position sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault to actuator"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,600]],"l"],"B0173":["HVAC Air Inlet Door","The HVAC control module has detected a fault on the fresh-air/recirculation inlet door — typically a stuck actuator or position feedback out of range.",[["h","Inlet door actuator failed"],["m","Inlet door mechanically binding"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0175":["HVAC Recirculation Door Performance","The HVAC control module has detected that the recirculation door does not reach the commanded position within the expected time. The recirc door switches between fresh air and recirculated cabin air.",[["h","Recirculation door actuator failed"],["m","Recirculation door mechanically binding"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0181":["Front Blower Motor Circuit Low","The HVAC control module has detected low voltage or a short to ground in the front blower motor circuit. The blower may run too slow or not at all.",[["h","Blower motor worn or seized"],["m","Blower resistor or power module failed"],["l","Wiring shorted to ground"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0182":["Right Front/Passenger Side Buckle Tension Sensor Circuit","The right front buckle tension sensor circuit is reporting a malfunction.",[["h","Sensor failure"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[120,500]],"l"],"B0184":["Rear Blower Motor Circuit","The HVAC control module has detected a fault in the rear blower motor circuit, used in vehicles with separate rear climate zones. Symptoms include no rear airflow or rear blower stuck on.",[["h","Rear blower motor failed"],["m","Rear blower resistor failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[100,600]],"l"],"B0186":["Front Blower Motor Speed Performance","The HVAC control module has detected that the front blower motor does not run at the commanded speed. Possible causes include a worn motor, blocked airway, or driver module fault.",[["h","Blower motor worn or seized"],["m","Cabin filter heavily blocked"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0188":["Rear Wiper Motor Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the rear wiper motor circuit. Possible faults include an open or shorted motor winding, a stuck mechanism, or wiring damage in the tailgate harness.",[["h","Rear wiper motor failed"],["m","Tailgate harness broken at hinge"],["l","Rear wiper fuse blown"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,350]],"l"],"B0190":["Front Wiper Park Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the front wiper park switch circuit. The wipers may not return to the park position when switched off.",[["h","Park switch in wiper motor failed"],["m","Wiring open or corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0192":["Front Wiper Speed Performance","The body control module has detected that the front wiper does not run at the commanded speed. Possible causes include a worn motor, binding linkage, or excessive load.",[["h","Wiper motor worn"],["m","Wiper linkage binding or seized"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0200":["Air Bag System Voltage Out of Range","The SRS module has detected that its supply voltage is outside the operating range, preventing reliable deployment readiness.",[["h","Weak or failing vehicle battery"],["m","Alternator output low or unstable"],["m","Damaged SRS power wiring"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,500]],"l"],"B0205":["HVAC Defroster Door Position","The HVAC control module has detected that the defroster door (windshield air outlet flap) does not reach the commanded position. Defrosting performance may be reduced.",[["h","Door actuator motor failed or stripped"],["m","Door linkage broken"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["hard",[200,1500]],"l"],"B0210":["Rain Sensor Module","The body control module has detected a fault in the rain sensor module on the windshield. Automatic wiper activation based on moisture detection is no longer available.",[["h","Rain sensor failed or detached"],["m","Windshield replaced without sensor recoding"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0220":["Front Wiper Motor Speed Circuit","The body control module has detected that the front wiper motor speed feedback does not match the commanded speed. The motor may run only on one speed or not at all.",[["h","Wiper motor brushes worn"],["m","Wiper relay failed"],["l","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,450]],"l"],"B0223":["SRS Indicator Lamp Circuit Malfunction","The SRS module has detected a fault in the airbag warning lamp circuit. The lamp may be inoperative, which prevents driver notification of stored faults.",[["h","Burnt-out warning bulb (older clusters)"],["m","Instrument cluster fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,600]],"l"],"B0226":["Headlamp Auto-Leveling Front Sensor","The body control module reports an implausible signal from the front ride-height sensor used by the automatic headlamp leveling system. Without valid input, the headlamp pitch cannot be corrected for vehicle load.",[["h","Front ride height sensor failed"],["m","Sensor linkage broken or detached"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0228":["Front Fog Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the front fog lamp circuit — typically an open bulb, blown fuse, or wiring fault. One or both fog lamps may not work.",[["h","Fog lamp bulb blown"],["m","Fog lamp fuse blown"],["l","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[20,200]],"l"],"B0231":["Front Marker Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the front side marker lamp circuit. The lamp does not match the commanded state — the bulb may be burned out or the wiring is open.",[["h","Bulb burned out"],["m","Wiring open or socket corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,100]],"l"],"B0233":["Rear Tail Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the rear tail lamp circuit. The lamp does not match the commanded state.",[["h","Bulb burned out"],["m","Wiring open or socket corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,100]],"l"],"B0235":["Brake Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the brake lamp circuit. One or more brake lamps do not match the commanded state — a safety-relevant fault.",[["h","Bulb burned out"],["m","Brake light switch failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,150]],"l"],"B0237":["Backup Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the backup (reverse) lamp circuit. The lamp does not match the commanded state when reverse gear is engaged.",[["h","Bulb burned out"],["m","Reverse switch failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,150]],"l"],"B0239":["License Plate Lamp Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the license plate lamp circuit. The lamp does not match the commanded state.",[["h","Bulb burned out"],["m","Wiring open or socket corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,100]],"l"],"B0240":["Headlamp Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected an implausible state at the headlamp switch — for example simultaneous low and high beam request, or no signal at all. Lighting functions may be erratic.",[["h","Headlamp switch worn or failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,400]],"l"],"B0245":["Driver Window Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver window switch circuit. The window may not respond to the switch in the driver door.",[["h","Window switch failed"],["m","Wiring open or shorted"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,250]],"l"],"B0247":["Passenger Window Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the passenger window switch circuit. Same fault profile as B0245 but for the passenger window.",[["h","Window switch failed"],["m","Wiring open or shorted"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,250]],"l"],"B0250":["HVAC Air Temperature Internal Sensor Circuit","The HVAC controller has detected a fault in the internal cabin air temperature sensor circuit, used to regulate climate control output.",[["h","Sensor element failure"],["m","Aspirator/blower fan dirty"],["m","Open wiring to sensor"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[40,200]],"l"],"B0252":["Driver Window Motor Down Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver window motor down-direction control circuit. The window may not lower correctly.",[["h","Window motor failed or seized"],["m","Wiring shorted or open"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0255":["HVAC Air Temperature External Sensor Circuit","A fault has been detected in the external (ambient) temperature sensor circuit used by the HVAC and instrument cluster.",[["h","Ambient sensor failure (often behind front grille)"],["m","Water in connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,150]],"l"],"B0258":["HVAC Air Mix Door 1 Circuit","The HVAC controller reports a fault in the actuator circuit for air mix door 1, which controls the proportion of warm and cool air in the airflow.",[["h","Air mix door actuator motor failed"],["m","Mix door jammed by debris"],["m","Open wiring to actuator"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0260":["Interior Light Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the interior light circuit. The lamp does not match the commanded state — common cause is a stuck door switch causing battery drain.",[["h","Door jamb switch stuck"],["m","Bulb burned out"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[10,150]],"l"],"B0263":["HVAC Air Mix Door 2 Circuit","A fault has been detected in the air mix door 2 actuator circuit, used in dual-zone HVAC systems for the passenger side.",[["h","Actuator motor failure"],["m","Mix door jammed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0265":["Driver Door Lock/Unlock Switch Circuit","Driver Door Lock/Unlock Switch Circuit: an electrical fault is present in the circuit. This affects central locking operated from this switch.",[["h","Lock/unlock switch failed"],["m","Door harness broken in hinge area"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,350]],"l"],"B0268":["HVAC Mode Door 1 Circuit","The HVAC mode door 1 actuator circuit, which routes airflow between defrost, vents, and floor, has reported a fault.",[["h","Mode actuator motor failure"],["m","Actuator out of calibration"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0270":["Passenger Door Lock Switch Circuit","Passenger Door Lock Switch Circuit: an electrical fault is present in the circuit. This affects central locking operated from this switch.",[["h","Lock switch failed"],["m","Door harness broken in hinge area"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,350]],"l"],"B0272":["Power Door Lock Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the power door lock switch circuit. Central locking may not respond to the door switch.",[["h","Lock switch failed"],["m","Wiring open or shorted"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0273":["HVAC Recirculation Door Circuit","The HVAC recirculation door actuator circuit has reported a fault. Fresh/recirculated air switching may not work.",[["h","Recirculation actuator failed"],["m","Recirculation door stuck"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0274":["Trunk Lid Release Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the trunk lid release switch circuit. The trunk may not open via the interior or remote release.",[["h","Release switch failed"],["m","Wiring open"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0278":["HVAC Defrost Door Circuit","A fault is detected in the HVAC defrost door actuator circuit; defrost airflow may not engage.",[["h","Defrost actuator failed"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0283":["HVAC Blower Motor Circuit","The HVAC controller reports a fault in the blower motor control circuit. Blower may run at incorrect speed or not at all.",[["h","Blower resistor or final stage failed"],["m","Worn blower motor brushes"],["l","Short in blower wiring"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[50,350]],"l"],"B0288":["HVAC A/C Pressure Sensor Circuit","A fault has been detected in the A/C refrigerant pressure sensor circuit. The compressor may be disabled to protect the system.",[["h","Pressure sensor failure"],["m","Low refrigerant charge"],["m","Faulty sensor connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[60,250]],"l"],"B0290":["Rear Defrost Switch Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the rear window defroster switch circuit. The switch may be stuck or its signal does not reach the module — the rear defroster cannot be activated.",[["h","Defrost switch failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[30,200]],"l"],"B0292":["HVAC A/C Compressor Clutch Circuit","The HVAC controller has detected a fault in the A/C compressor clutch control circuit. The compressor may not engage.",[["h","Compressor clutch coil open"],["m","A/C relay failed"],["m","Corroded compressor connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,600]],"l"],"B0300":["HVAC Evaporator Temperature Sensor Circuit","The HVAC controller reports a fault in the evaporator temperature sensor circuit, used to prevent evaporator icing.",[["h","Evaporator sensor failure"],["m","Faulty sensor connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0305":["HVAC Sun Load Sensor Circuit","A fault has been detected in the sun load sensor circuit used by automatic climate control to compensate for solar gain.",[["h","Sun load sensor failure"],["m","Open wire in dashboard"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[60,250]],"l"],"B0310":["Driver Seat Position Sensor Circuit","Driver Seat Position Sensor Circuit: an electrical fault is present in the circuit. The sensor reports seat position for the memory function and SRS occupant logic.",[["h","Seat position sensor failed"],["m","Seat harness connector damaged"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0312":["Driver Seat Forward/Back Switch Circuit","The seat module has detected a fault in the fore/aft adjustment switch on the driver seat. Manual adjustment of the seat position may be limited or not work at all.",[["h","Seat adjustment switch failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[50,400]],"l"],"B0320":["Passenger Seat Position Sensor Circuit","Passenger Seat Position Sensor Circuit: an electrical fault is present in the circuit. The sensor reports seat position for the memory function and SRS occupant logic.",[["h","Seat position sensor failed"],["m","Seat harness connector damaged"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0322":["Driver Seat Tilt Position Sensor","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver seat tilt position sensor. Memory positions for seat back tilt cannot be reliably stored.",[["h","Tilt position sensor failed"],["m","Wiring open under seat"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0325":["Driver Seat Memory Set Switch","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver seat memory set switch circuit. Seat positions cannot be saved to memory presets.",[["h","Memory set switch failed"],["m","Wiring open or shorted"],["l","Module software outdated, reflash may resolve"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["easy",[40,250]],"l"],"B0327":["Passenger Seat Position Memory","The body control module has detected a fault in the passenger seat position memory function. Saved positions cannot be reliably restored.",[["h","Position sensor failed"],["m","Seat module internal fault"],["l","Module software outdated, reflash may resolve"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,500]],"l"],"B0330":["HVAC Rear Blower Motor Circuit","The HVAC controller reports a fault in the rear blower motor circuit, used in vehicles with rear climate zone.",[["h","Rear blower resistor failed"],["m","Rear blower motor worn"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,400]],"l"],"B0335":["Driver Seat Heater Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the driver seat heater circuit. The heating element or wiring is open or shorted — the seat does not heat.",[["h","Heater element broken"],["m","Seat connector corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[150,800]],"l"],"B0337":["Passenger Seat Heater Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the passenger seat heater circuit. Same fault profile as B0335 but for the passenger seat.",[["h","Heater element broken"],["m","Seat connector corroded"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[150,800]],"l"],"B0339":["Rear Seat Heater Circuit","The body control module has detected a fault in the rear seat heater circuit. The rear heating elements are open or shorted.",[["h","Heater element broken"],["m","Wiring open under seat"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[150,800]],"l"],"B0341":["HVAC Heated Seat Driver Circuit","A fault has been detected in the driver heated seat circuit. Seat heating may be disabled.",[["h","Heating element broken"],["m","Seat temperature sensor fault"],["m","Loose seat connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,600]],"l"],"B0342":["HVAC Heated Seat Passenger Circuit","A fault has been detected in the passenger heated seat circuit.",[["h","Heating element broken"],["m","Loose seat connector"]],["Warning light or symbol related to the affected system","Comfort or safety function impaired"],["medium",[80,600]],"l"],"B0420":["Audio System Internal Failure","The audio head unit reports an internal self-test failure. Symptoms include silent output, frozen display, or repeated reboots of the infotainment system.",[["h","Head