y come from chafing, water ingress at connector seals, or pin push-back — a wiggle test on the harness while the code is active often confirms the location.",[["h","Supply wire shorted to battery"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[50,400]],"l"],"C056F":["Brake Booster Travel Sensor Circuit Low","Brake booster travel sensor signal voltage below expected range. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to ground"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Harness chafing through insulation"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["hard",[150,1200]],"l"],"C0570":["Brake Booster Travel Sensor Circuit High","Brake booster travel sensor signal voltage above expected range. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to battery"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["hard",[150,1200]],"l"],"C0571":["Active Brake Assist Performance","The brake assist or driver assistance module has detected that brake assist performance is degraded. The system may fail to autonomously build pressure during emergency braking and emergency brake assist functions are limited.",[["h","Active booster slow or weak"],["m","Secondary fault on related sensor"],["l","System calibration required after repair"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["hard",[200,2500]],"l"],"C0572":["Brake Pressure Sensor C Circuit High","Brake pressure sensor C signal voltage above expected range. Wiring faults of this kind typically come from chafing, water ingress at connector seals, or pin push-back — a wiggle test on the harness while the code is active often confirms the location.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to battery"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[200,1500]],"l"],"C0573":["Electric Park Brake Switch Circuit Malfunction","The electric park brake (EPB) module has detected an implausible signal from the operator switch. The EPB cannot be reliably applied or released by the driver until the fault is corrected.",[["h","EPB switch failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["easy",[60,300]],"l"],"C0574":["Brake Pressure Sensor C Circuit Range/Performance","Brake pressure sensor C reading implausible. Wiring faults of this kind typically come from chafing, water ingress at connector seals, or pin push-back — a wiggle test on the harness while the code is active often confirms the location.",[["h","Sensor reading drifted"],["l","Sensor element aged beyond calibration window"],["l","Sensor mounting loose - signal damping"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[200,1500]],"l"],"C0575":["Park Brake Actuator Position Signal Malfunction","The EPB module has detected an out-of-range position signal from a caliper actuator. The module cannot determine whether the brake is fully applied or released.",[["h","Actuator position sensor failed"],["m","Actuator mechanically jammed (corrosion)"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[200,900]],"l"],"C0576":["Brake Pressure Sensor D Circuit High","Brake pressure sensor D signal voltage above expected range. Wiring faults of this kind typically come from chafing, water ingress at connector seals, or pin push-back — a wiggle test on the harness while the code is active often confirms the location.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to battery"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[200,1500]],"l"],"C0577":["Park Brake Force Sensor Circuit Malfunction","The EPB module has detected an electrical fault in the clamp-force sensor circuit. Without this signal, regulated clamping force cannot be ensured and a fallback strategy is used.",[["h","Clamp-force sensor failed"],["m","Wiring or connector fault"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["hard",[200,900]],"l"],"C0578":["Park Brake Switch Stuck Open","The EPB module has detected that the park brake operator switch remains in the open (released) state when an apply request is expected. Operation of the EPB by the driver is restricted.",[["h","EPB switch contacts stuck open"],["m","Wiring break in switch circuit"],["l","Carbon or debris buildup preventing free movement"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["easy",[60,300]],"l"],"C0579":["Brake Booster Temperature Sensor B Circuit Low","Brake booster temperature sensor B signal voltage below expected range. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to ground"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Harness chafing through insulation"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stability control deactivated","Possible reduced brake assist"],["medium",[150,1200]],"l"],"C057A":["Brake Booster Temperature Sensor B Circuit High","Brake booster temperature sensor B signal voltage above expected range. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to battery"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["ABS warning light on","ESC/stabil