r 6.",[["h","Injector coked, leaking or delivering the wrong quantity"],["m","Compression loss (valve, rings)"],["m","Partial combustion or misfire (fuel quality, EGR distribution)"],["l","Pressure sensor drifting"]],["Check engine light on","Rough running, vibration","Loss of power, more smoke and consumption"],["hard",[150,1500]],"u"],"P03D1":["Cylinder 7 Pressure Sensor Circuit","Some diesels have a combustion pressure sensor in the glow plug; the engine module uses it to control injection for each cylinder. This code concerns cylinder 7.",[["h","Connector at the pressure-sensing glow plug loose or corroded"],["m","Reference, signal or ground wire open or shorted"],["m","Sensor electronics in the glow plug faulty"],["l","Engine module (reference voltage or input)"]],["Check engine light on (often after two trips)","Usually barely noticeable – combustion control for the cylinder is switched off","Possibly rougher running, more noise or slightly higher consumption"],["medium",[50,400]],"u"],"P03D2":["Cylinder 7 Pressure Sensor Circuit Range/Performance","Some diesels have a combustion pressure sensor in the glow plug; the engine module uses it to control injection for each cylinder. This code concerns cylinder 7.",[["h","Sensor in the glow plug drifting (deposits, ageing)"],["m","Glow plug leaking or wrongly torqued (pressure transmitted wrongly)"],["m","Contact resistance in connector or ground"],["l","Actual compression pressure differs (valve, rings)"]],["Check engine light on","Combustion control for the cylinder off – slightly rough running, more noise","Possibly more smoke or consumption"],["medium",[120,500]],"u"],"P03D3":["Cylinder 7 Pressure Sensor Circuit Low","Some diesels have a combustion pressure sensor in the glow plug; the engine module uses it to control injection for each cylinder. This code concerns cylinder 7.",[["h","5 V reference wire open or shorted to ground"],["m","Signal wire shorted to ground"],["m","Sensor electronics of the glow plug fa