nk in cold weather, or a degraded SCR catalyst.",[["h","Poor reductant quality or contamination"],["m","Dosing module clogged with urea crystals"],["m","SCR catalyst aged or contaminated"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["hard",[200,3000]],"c"],"P2050":["Reductant Injection Valve Circuit/Open (Bank 2 Unit 1)","Reductant Injection Valve Circuit/Open (Bank 2 Unit 1): the circuit is open. This valve doses reductant (DEF/AdBlue) into the exhaust for SCR NOx reduction.",[["h","Solenoid winding open"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"],["l","Cracked solder joint inside the module or sensor"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["medium",[120,900]],"c"],"P2051":["Reductant Injection Valve Circuit Low (Bank 2 Unit 1)","Reductant Injection Valve Circuit Low (Bank 2 Unit 1): the signal voltage is below the expected range. This valve doses reductant (DEF/AdBlue) into the exhaust for SCR NOx reduction.",[["h","Short to ground"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Harness chafing through insulation"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["medium",[120,900]],"c"],"P2052":["Reductant Injection Valve Circuit High (Bank 2 Unit 1)","Reductant Injection Valve Circuit High (Bank 2 Unit 1): the signal voltage is above the expected range. This valve doses reductant (DEF/AdBlue) into the exhaust for SCR NOx reduction.",[["h","Short to B+"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["medium",[120,900]],"c"],"P2053":["Reductant Injection Valve Circuit/Open (Bank 1 Unit 2)","Reductant