ng through insulation"]],["Check engine light on","Misfire or rough idle on the affected cylinder","Increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"P20D4":["Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Control Circuit High","Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Control Circuit High: the control-circuit voltage is above the expected range. This injector doses fuel into the exhaust to raise temperature for diesel particulate-filter regeneration; it does not fuel the engine.",[["h","Short to B+"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["Check engine light on","Misfire or rough idle on the affected cylinder","Increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"P20D5":["Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Stuck Open","Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Stuck Open: the control module has detected this fault condition. This injector doses fuel into the exhaust to raise temperature for diesel particulate-filter regeneration; it does not fuel the engine.",[["h","Injector stuck open"],["l","Carbon or debris buildup preventing free movement"],["l","Component wear with age - mechanical play"]],["Check engine light on","Misfire or rough idle on the affected cylinder","Increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[250,2000]],"c"],"P20D6":["Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Stuck Closed","Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Injector B Stuck Closed: the control module has detected this fault condition. This injector doses fuel into the exhaust to raise temperature for diesel particulate-filter regeneration; it does not fuel the engine.",[["h","Injector stuck closed"],["l","Carbon or debris buildup preventing free movement"],["l","Component wear with age - mechanical play"]],["Check engine light on","Misfire or rough idle on the affected cylinder","Increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[250,2000]],"c"],"P20D7":["Exhaust Aftertreatment Fuel Supply Control Circuit/Open","The control circuit for the dedicated aftertreat