ustics, EGR boost, or aftertreatment heating).",[["h","Open coil in valve solenoid"],["m","Broken control wire"]],[],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"P26C6":["Exhaust Flow Control Valve A Control Circuit Low","Voltage on the exhaust flow control valve A control line is below the expected window. The exhaust control valve modulates exhaust backpressure or routing (EGR feed, sound, regen support); a malfunction shifts torque mapping and may trigger limp mode.",[["h","Control wire shorted to ground"],["m","Internal short in solenoid coil"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],[],["medium",[150,1200]],"u"],"P26C7":["Exhaust Flow Control Valve A Control Circuit High","Voltage on the exhaust flow control valve A control line is above the expected window. The exhaust control valve modulates exhaust backpressure or routing (EGR feed, sound, regen support); a malfunction shifts torque mapping and may trigger limp mode.",[["h","Control wire shorted to B+"],["m","Open solenoid coil"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],[],["medium",[150,1200]],"u"],"P26C8":["Chassis Control Module 1 Requested MIL Illumination","A chassis control module (typically active suspension, AWD coupling, or steering controller) has signalled an emissions-relevant fault and requested the engine controller to switch on the MIL.",[["h","Active DTC stored in the chassis module"],["l","Communication loss interpreted as MIL request"]],[],["medium",[80,600]],"u"],"P26C9":["Chassis Control Module 2 Requested MIL Illumination","A second chassis control module has signalled an emissions-relevant fault and requested the engine controller to switch on the MIL.",[["h","Active DTC stored in the chassis module"],["l","Communication loss interpreted as MIL request"]],[],["medium",[80,600]],"u"],"P26CA":["Engine Coolant Pump Control Circuit / Open","The controller cannot drive the main electric coolant pump. Without flow the engine and aftertreatment will overheat under load.",[[