, or short to ground/battery in the harness.",[["h","Open solenoid coil"],["m","Short to ground or battery in the harness"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[200,1800]],"c"],"P270A":["Transmission Friction Element A Temperature Too High","Friction element A inside the automatic transmission has reached over-temperature. Excessive slip during shifts or trailer towing burns the clutch.",[["h","Excessive slip due to worn clutch or low pressure"],["m","Restricted transmission fluid cooler"],["m","Sustained heavy load such as trailer towing"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,4000]],"u"],"P270B":["Transmission Friction Element B Temperature Too High","Friction element B inside the automatic transmission has reached over-temperature.",[["h","Excessive slip due to worn clutch or low pressure"],["m","Restricted transmission fluid cooler"],["m","Sustained heavy load such as trailer towing"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,4000]],"u"],"P270C":["Transmission Friction Element C Temperature Too High","Friction element C inside the automatic transmission has reached over-temperature.",[["h","Excessive slip due to worn clutch or low pressure"],["m","Restricted transmission fluid cooler"],["m","Sustained heavy load such as trailer towing"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,4000]],"u"],"P270D":["Transmission Friction Element D Temperature Too High","Friction element D inside the automatic transmission has reached over-temperature.",[["h","Excessive slip due to worn clutch or low pressure"],["m","Restricted transmission fluid cooler"],["m","Sustained heavy load 