"]],[],["medium",[100,600]],"u"],"P28C1":["Ion Sense Module Supply Voltage Low","Supply voltage on the ion sense module is below the expected window. Wiring shorted to ground, blown fuse, or upstream regulator fault.",[["h","Module supply fuse blown"],["m","Supply wire shorted to ground"]],[],["medium",[100,600]],"u"],"P28C2":["Ion Sense Module Supply Voltage High","Supply voltage on the ion sense module is above the expected window. Charging system overvoltage or upstream regulator fault.",[["h","Alternator regulator drift - overvoltage"],["m","Supply wire shorted to B+"]],[],["medium",[100,600]],"u"],"P28C3":["EVAP System High Load Purge Line B Performance","The ECM detects insufficient flow or pressure in the high-load purge line B of the evaporative emissions system. Purge cannot be commanded effectively under high engine load.",[["h","Purge line B restricted or kinked"],["m","Purge valve B partially open"]],["Check engine light on","Possible smell of fuel near tank or engine bay","Failed emissions inspection"],["medium",[80,400]],"u"],"P28C4":["Clutch A Phase U-V-W Circuit Low","The output stage for the clutch A BLDC motor reports a low phase voltage on at least one of the U/V/W phases. Short to ground or interrupted half-bridge.",[["h","Phase wire shorted to ground"],["m","Low-side switch open in driver"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[500,2800]],"u"],"P28C5":["Clutch A Phase U-V-W Circuit High","The output stage for the clutch A BLDC motor reports a high phase voltage on at least one of the U/V/W phases. Short to B+ or interrupted load.",[["h","Phase wire shorted to B+"],["m","Open motor winding"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[500,280