 transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,2200]],"u"],"P28E6":["Shift Motor Overspeed","The shift motor exceeds the calibrated maximum speed. Mechanical load lost or rotor position offset.",[["h","Mechanical coupling broken - load lost"],["m","Rotor position sensor offset"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,2200]],"u"],"P28E7":["Shift Motor Position Sensor Circuit/Open","The TCM cannot read a valid signal from the shift motor rotor position sensor. Open wiring or sensor failure.",[["h","Open in sensor signal wire"],["m","Position sensor failed"],["l","Pin pushed back out of connector body"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,2200]],"u"],"P28E8":["Shift Motor Position Sensor Circuit High","Voltage on the shift motor position sensor signal line is above the expected window. Wire shorted to B+ or sensor open.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to B+"],["m","Open position sensor"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,2200]],"u"],"P28E9":["Shift Motor Position Sensor Circuit Low","Voltage on the shift motor position sensor signal line is below the expected window. Wire shorted to ground or sensor short.",[["h","Signal wire shorted to ground"],["m","Internal sensor short"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"]],["Check engine or transmission warning light on","Harsh, delayed, or missing shifts","Possible limp mode (locked in one gear)"],["hard",[400,2200]],"u"],"P28EA":["Shift Motor Position Sensor Circuit Range/Performance","The shift motor position signal does not correlate with the commanded commutation. 