 calibrated learning window. Sensor or mechanism out of nominal range.",[["h","Mechanical wear shifted end-stops"],["m","Sensor reference drifted"]],[],["medium",[200,1200]],"u"],"P2B94":["Wastegate Position Sensor B Exceeded Learning Limit","The required adaptation offset for the wastegate position sensor B exceeds the calibrated learning window. Sensor or mechanism out of nominal range.",[["h","Mechanical wear shifted end-stops"],["m","Sensor reference drifted"]],[],["medium",[200,1200]],"u"],"P2B95":["Cold Start Injection Pulse Performance","During cold start, the ECM detects that the overall injection pulse performance does not match the calibrated cold-start strategy. Combustion stability is reduced during warm-up.",[["h","Injectors aged - flow drift across cylinders"],["m","Fuel rail pressure drifts during pulse"]],[],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"P2B96":["Injection Pulse Performance","The ECM detects that the overall injection pulse performance does not match the calibrated values. Combustion result deviates from expected fuelling behaviour.",[["h","Injectors aged - flow drift across cylinders"],["m","Fuel rail pressure drifts during pulse"]],[],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"P2B97":["Exhaust Pressure Control Valve A Position Exceeded Learning Limit","The required adaptation offset for the exhaust pressure control valve A position exceeds the calibrated learning window. Mechanical wear or sensor drift beyond compensation.",[["h","Valve mechanism worn at end-stops"],["m","Position sensor reference drifted"]],[],["hard",[300,1500]],"u"],"P2B98":["Exhaust Pressure Control Valve A Supply Low","The supply voltage to the exhaust pressure control valve A actuator is below the expected window. Fuse blown, supply wire shorted, or upstream regulator fault.",[["h","Supply fuse blown"],["m","Supply wire shorted to ground"]],[],["medium",[100,500]],"u"],"P2B99":["Exhaust Pressure Control Valve A Driver Current/Temperature Too High","The output driver for the exhaust pressure c