that the exhaust gas composition reaching the particulate filter (feedgas) deviates from the calibrated profile. Soot input rate cannot be modelled correctly, affecting regen scheduling.",[["h","Exhaust leak upstream of DPF"],["m","EGT sensor pre-DPF drift"]],["Check engine light or DPF warning light on","Power loss / limp mode","Increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[200,1800]],"u"],"P2BA6":["NOx Exceedance - SCR NOx Catalyst Performance","NOx emissions are above the legal threshold and the ECU isolates the cause to the SCR NOx catalyst. Conversion efficiency is degraded — aged substrate, sulphur poisoning, or thermal damage.",[["h","SCR catalyst substrate aged or contaminated"],["m","Thermal damage from prior over-temperature event"]],["Check engine light on","Failed emissions inspection","Possibly slightly increased fuel consumption"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"P2BA7":["NOx Exceedence - Empty Reagent Tank","NOx emissions are above the legal threshold and the ECU isolates the cause to an empty reductant tank. SCR cannot dose AdBlue/DEF.",[["h","DEF/AdBlue tank empty - refill required"],["m","Level sensor reads empty incorrectly"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["hard",[200,2000]],"c"],"P2BA8":["NOx Exceedence - Interruption of Reagent Dosing Activity","NOx emissions are above the legal threshold and the ECU isolates the cause to interruption of reductant dosing. The injection valve, pump, or supply line is impaired.",[["h","Reductant injection valve clogged"],["m","Reductant pump output insufficient"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["hard",[200,2000]],"c"],"P2BA9":["NOx Exceedence — Insufficient Reagent","The SCR system has detected that NOx emissions exceed the legal limit and the cause is traced to insufficient AdBlue/DEF dosing. Modern emission regulations require this fault to be reported separately so that operator-induced misuse (running an empty tank, diluting the fluid) is recorded.",[["h","DEF tank repeatedly run empty"],["m","Diluted or contaminated DEF"],["m","Dosing pump output below spec"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["medium",[200,1500]],"c"],"P2BAB":["NOx Exceedence — Reagent System Performance","The SCR system has detected that NOx emissions exceed the legal limit and the cause is traced to a performance fault in the reagent dosing system — for example a slow dosing pump, a clogged injector, or a frozen line that is not yet caught by another DTC.",[["h","Reductant injector clogged with crystals"],["m","Dosing pump output below spec"],["m","Reagent supply line blocked"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["medium",[200,1500]],"c"],"P2BAD":["NOx Exceedence - Insufficient Reagent Consumption","The aftertreatment system detects elevated NOx emissions while reagent (AdBlue/DEF) consumption is below the expected level. Causes include clogged dosing injector, incorrect dosing rate or tampering.",[["h","Clogged DEF dosing valve"],["m","Incorrect dosing calibration"]],["Check engine light or NOx warning on","AdBlue/DEF level or quality warning","Possible no-start countdown after ignore period"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"P2BAE":["NOx Exceedence - EGR System","NOx emissions are above the legal threshold and the ECU isolates the cause to the EGR system. EGR flow is too low or absent under operating conditions where NOx reduction is required.",[["h","EGR valve stuck closed"],["h","Carbon clogged EGR passages"]],["Check engine light on","Pinging or knocking under load","Power loss and hesitation"],["hard",[300,1800]],"c"],"P2BAF":["NOx Sensor Heater Sense Circuit Range/Performance Bank 1 Sensor 1","The heater sense feedback of NOx sensor