ck engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["medium",[80,500]],"u"],"P34A7":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Temperature Sensor Circuit High Bank 1","Cam actuator A temperature sensor on bank 1 signal voltage above expected range — short to power or open.",[["h","Signal wire open"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["medium",[80,500]],"u"],"P34A8":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Temperature Sensor Circuit Bank 2","Generic electrical fault on the temperature sensor of the intake camshaft position actuator on bank 2. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Temperature sensor failed"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,1500]],"u"],"P34A9":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Temperature Sensor Range/Performance Bank 2","Cam actuator A temperature sensor on bank 2 reads implausibly compared to engine warm-up state. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Sensor reading drifted"],["l","Sensor element aged beyond calibration window"],["l","Sensor mounting loose - signal damping"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,1500]],"u"],"P34AA":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Temperature Sensor Circuit Low Bank 2","Cam actuator A temperature sensor on bank 2 signal voltage below expected range. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-o