uential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Signal wire open"],["l","Connector pins corroded - high contact resistance"],["l","Supply wire pinched against B+ source"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["medium",[80,500]],"u"],"P34C4":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Control Circuit Driver Current/Temperature Too High Bank 1","The driver stage controlling the intake cam position actuator on bank 1 reports overcurrent or overtemperature, triggering thermal shutdown to protect the electronics.",[["h","Short circuit in actuator wiring or coil"],["m","Actuator mechanically seized, drawing high current"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"P34C5":["A Camshaft Position Actuator Control Circuit Driver Current/Temperature Too High Bank 2","Driver stage controlling the intake cam position actuator on bank 2 reports overcurrent or overtemperature. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Short circuit in actuator wiring or coil"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"P34C6":["B Camshaft Position Actuator Control Circuit Driver Current/Temperature Too High Bank 1","Driver stage controlling the exhaust cam position actuator on bank 1 reports overcurrent or overtemperature. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Short circuit in actuator wiring or coil"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"P34C7":["B Camshaft Position Actuator Control Circuit Driver Current/Temperature Too High Bank 2","Driver stage controlling the exhaust cam position actuator on bank 2 reports overcurrent or overtemperature. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Short circuit in actuator wiring or coil"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"P34C8":["Camshaft Position Control Module Performance","The dedicated camshaft position control module reports an internal performance fault — self-diagnostic flagged an issue with internal computation, drivers or sensor interfaces.",[["h","Module internal fault"],["l","Module software outdated, reflash may resolve"],["l","Supply voltage outside specification"]],["Check engine light on","Power loss especially in mid-rpm range","Possible rough idle or stalling"],["hard",[400,2500]],"u"],"U0001":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus","A general fault on the high-speed CAN bus has been detected. This bus typically connects powertrain modules (ECM, TCM, ABS) at 500 kbit/s and a fault disables communication between them, often triggering multiple secondary DTCs in other modules.",[["h","CAN-High and CAN-Low shorted together"],["h","Open circuit in CAN bus wiring"],["m","Terminating resistor failed (not 60 ohms across bus)"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0002":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus Performance","The high-speed CAN bus is functional but performance is degraded — frame errors, bit errors or excessive bus load have been detected. Communication may be intermittent rather than completely lost, leading to sporadic warning lamps.",[["h","Corrosion or poor contact in CAN connectors"],["m","Electromagnetic interference (aftermarket electronics)"],["m","One module sending malformed frames"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0003":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Open","The CAN-High line of the high-speed bus is open. Without the differential pair, the controller cannot decode any traffic and reports loss of all participating modules at once.",[["h","CAN-High wire broken or pin pushed back"],["m","Corroded module connector"],["m","Harness damage after repair or accident"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0004":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Low","The CAN-High signal stays below its valid voltage window. Common cause is a short to ground on the CAN-H wire or a transceiver that pulls the line down.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to ground"],["m","Internal transceiver failure on a node"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,700]],"c"],"U0005":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) High","The CAN-High line is held above its valid voltage range, usually because of a short to battery voltage. Bus communication collapses for every connected module.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to battery voltage"],["m","Chafed harness against power wire"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0006":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Open","The CAN-Low wire of the high-speed bus is open. The differential signal can no longer be evaluated correctly, so all bus participants report communication loss simultaneously.",[["h","CAN-Low wire broken"],["m","Pin pushed back in connector"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0007":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Low","The CAN-Low line is shorted to ground or held below its valid recessive level. The differential pair cannot transmit data and the bus is effectively dead.",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to ground"],["m","Failed transceiver on one module"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,700]],"c"],"U0008":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) High","The CAN-Low signal is held above its valid range, typically because of a short to battery voltage on the CAN-L wire. Bus communication is lost for every node sharing this segment.",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to battery voltage"],["m","Chafed harness against power wire"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0009":["High Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Shorted to Bus (+)","CAN-High and CAN-Low are shorted together. The differential signal collapses to zero and the bus controller can no longer separate dominant from recessive bits, so all communication stops.",[["h","CAN-H and CAN-L shorted together"],["m","Pinched harness behind a module"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0010":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus","A fault on the medium-speed CAN bus has been detected. This bus (typically 125 kbit/s) connects body and comfort modules — BCM, climate, doors, infotainment.",[["h","MS-CAN line shorted to supply or ground"],["m","One failing comfort module pulling the bus down"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0011":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus Performance","The medium-speed CAN bus is operating but with degraded performance — frame errors or excessive error counters. Comfort and infotainment functions may operate intermittently.",[["h","Corrosion in body harness connectors"],["m","One module sending malformed frames"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0012":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Open","The CAN-Low wire on the medium-speed comfort/body bus is open. Body modules such as door modules, climate control or seat modules lose communication, but powertrain functions usually stay alive.",[["h","CAN-Low wire broken in body harness"],["m","Loose body control module connector"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0013":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Low","The CAN-Low signal of the medium-speed bus is shorted to ground. Comfort and body modules can no longer exchange messages and trigger several user-visible faults at once (windows, locking, lighting).",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to ground"],["m","Water ingress in door connector"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0014":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) High","CAN-Low on the medium-speed bus is shorted to battery voltage. The differential bus cannot work, body and comfort modules drop out of the network.",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0015":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Shorted to Bus (+)","CAN-High and CAN-Low on the medium-speed bus are shorted together. The differential signal collapses; body and comfort modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-H/CAN-L harness short"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0016":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus Off","A controller on the medium-speed comfort bus has shut its transceiver off after too many consecutive transmit errors. Comfort and body functions stop responding until the bus recovers or is repaired.",[["h","Wiring short forces bus-off state"],["m","One failing node corrupts traffic"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,700]],"c"],"U0017":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Open","The CAN-High wire of the medium-speed bus is open. Body and comfort modules drop offline; the cluster typically displays multiple comfort warnings simultaneously.",[["h","CAN-High wire broken in body harness"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0018":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Low","CAN-High on the medium-speed bus is shorted to ground. The differential pair cannot work, all body and comfort nodes drop offline at the same time.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0019":["Medium Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) High","CAN-High on the medium-speed bus is shorted to battery voltage. The bus is non-functional and all comfort modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0020":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Open","The CAN-High wire of a low-speed comfort bus (e.g. ISO 11898-3 / fault-tolerant CAN) is open.",[["h","CAN-High wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0021":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Low","CAN-High on the low-speed comfort bus is shorted to ground. Bus signaling is impaired or lost; affected comfort modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0022":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) High","CAN-High on the low-speed bus is shorted to battery. Single-wire fallback is also disturbed; comfort modules report communication faults.",[["h","CAN-High shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0023":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (+) Shorted to Bus (-)","CAN-High and CAN-Low on the low-speed comfort bus are shorted together. Both differential and single-wire modes fail; comfort modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-H/CAN-L shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0024":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus Off","The low-speed CAN controller has gone bus-off after repeated error frames. The fault-tolerant single-wire fallback is exhausted and the bus stops carrying traffic.",[["h","Wiring short keeps bus in bus-off"],["m","One failing node spamming errors"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,700]],"c"],"U0025":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Open","CAN-Low on the low-speed comfort bus is open. The bus runs in single-wire fallback only; a fault is set because fault-tolerance is lost.",[["h","CAN-Low wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0026":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) Low","CAN-Low on the low-speed bus is shorted to ground. Differential signaling is no longer reliable, modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"c"],"U0027":["Low Speed CAN Communication Bus (-) High","CAN-Low on the low-speed bus is shorted to battery. Bus signaling is no longer possible; comfort modules drop offline.",[["h","CAN-Low shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0028":["Vehicle Communication Bus A","Generic fault on vehicle communication bus A. The controller flags an unspecified electrical or protocol fault on this bus segment that does not match the more specific U0xxx subcodes.",[["h","Intermittent CAN wiring fault"],["m","Marginal node corrupting traffic"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,700]],"c"],"U0032":["Vehicle Communication Bus A (+) High","The communication bus A high-side line (CAN-H or equivalent) is at a higher voltage than allowed. Likely short to power or a transceiver fault that pulls the line high.",[["h","Bus high line shorted to battery"],["m","Transceiver in one node failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0033":["Vehicle Communication Bus A (-) Open","The communication bus A low-side line (CAN-L) is open — broken wire, unplugged connector, or terminator missing.",[["h","CAN-L wire broken or unplugged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0034":["Vehicle Communication Bus A (-) Low","Bus A low-side line voltage below the expected range. Short to ground or transceiver pulling line low.",[["h","CAN-L shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0035":["Vehicle Communication Bus A (-) High","Bus A low-side line voltage above the expected range. Short to power or transceiver fault.",[["h","CAN-L shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0036":["Vehicle Communication Bus A (-) shorted to Bus A (+)","The two lines of differential bus A are shorted together. Communication impossible — both lines see the same voltage.",[["h","CAN-H/CAN-L shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0037":["Vehicle Communication Bus B","Generic fault on vehicle communication bus B (second physical bus, e.g. body CAN, comfort CAN, or LIN).",[["h","Wiring or node fault on bus B"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0038":["Vehicle Communication Bus B Performance","Bus B is electrically OK but message rate or error counters are outside spec. Often intermittent wiring or a degraded transceiver.",[["h","Wiring chafed or marginal"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"c"],"U0039":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (+) Open","Bus B high-side line is open — broken wire or disconnected. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire broken or connector unplugged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0040":["Communication Bus Off","A control module has counted enough transmit errors to enter the bus-off state defined by ISO 11898 and stops transmitting on the bus. Multiple modules typically lose communication and several warning lamps illuminate at once.",[["h","CAN line shorted to supply or ground"],["m","Terminating resistor failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0041":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (+) High","Bus B high-side line voltage above expected range — short to power or transceiver fault. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0043":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (-) Low","Bus B low-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0044":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (-) High","Bus B low-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0045":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (-) shorted to Bus B (+)","The two lines of differential bus B are shorted together. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Bus lines shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0046":["Vehicle Communication Bus C","Generic fault on bus C (third bus, often chassis CAN or diagnostic CAN). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or node fault on bus C"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0047":["Vehicle Communication Bus C Performance","Bus C is electrically OK but message rate or error counters are outside spec. Often intermittent wiring or a degraded transceiver.",[["h","Wiring chafed or marginal"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"c"],"U0048":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (+) Open","Bus C high-side line open. Same diagnostic as U0039 on bus C.",[["h","Wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0049":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (+) Low","Bus C high-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0051":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (-) Open","Bus C low-side line open. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0052":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (-) Low","Bus C low-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0053":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (-) High","Bus C low-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0054":["Vehicle Communication Bus C (-) shorted to Bus C (+)","Bus C lines shorted together. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Bus lines shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0055":["Vehicle Communication Bus D","Generic fault on bus D (fourth bus, often dedicated subsystem like infotainment or driver assistance).",[["h","Wiring or node fault on bus D"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0056":["Vehicle Communication Bus D Performance","Bus D error counters or message rate out of spec. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring chafed or marginal"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"c"],"U0057":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (+) Open","Bus D high-side line open. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0058":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (+) Low","Bus D high-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0059":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (+) High","Bus D high-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0061":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (-) Low","Bus D low-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0062":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (-) High","Bus D low-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0063":["Vehicle Communication Bus D (-) shorted to Bus D (+)","Bus D lines shorted together. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Bus lines shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN termina