us E high-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0068":["Vehicle Communication Bus E (+) High","Bus E high-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0069":["Vehicle Communication Bus E (-) Open","Bus E low-side line open. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0073":["Control Module Communication Bus \"A\" Off","A control module has detected that the communication bus is non-functional and has shut its bus interface off. Affects multiple modules at once because none can communicate; on most vehicles the dashboard lights up with several warning lamps simultaneously.",[["h","CAN line shorted to supply or ground"],["m","Terminating resistor failed"],["m","One failing module pulling the bus down"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0074":["Control Module Communication Bus \"B\" Off","A control module has shut its bus B interface off because the bus is non-functional. Bus B is typically a secondary CAN segment (often body or chassis) and a failure disables all modules connected to it.",[["h","Bus B line shorted to supply or ground"],["m","One failing module pulling the bus down"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0075":["Control Module Communication Bus \"B\" Performance","Bus B is operational but performance is degraded — error frames or out-of-spec timing. Modules on this bus may behave erratically.",[["h","Corrosion or poor contact in connectors"],["m","One module sending malformed frames"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1200]],"u"],"U0076":["Control Module Communication Bus \"C\" Off","A control module has shut its bus C interface off because the bus is non-functional. Bus C is typically a tertiary CAN or LIN segment used for diagnostic or specialized subsystems.",[["h","Bus C line shorted to supply or ground"],["m","One failing module pulling the bus down"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"u"],"U0077":["Vehicle Communication Bus B Off","A controller on bus B has reached its transmit error limit and shut its transceiver off. All traffic on this segment stops until the cause is removed.",[["h","Persistent wiring fault on bus B"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"u"],"U0078":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (+) Open","The plus wire of bus B is open. Modules on this segment lose communication.",[["h","Bus-B plus wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,500]],"u"],"U0079":["Vehicle Communication Bus B (+) Low","The plus line of bus B is shorted to ground. The differential signal collapses and bus traffic stops.",[["h","Bus-B plus shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"u"],"U007A":["Control Module Communication Bus H Off","The control module communication bus H is off — the gateway has shut down or isolated this bus, often due to repeated bus errors or a \"bus off\" event in the CAN controller.",[["h","CAN controller in bus-off state from repeated errors"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["har