n","Bus H low-side line open. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1000]],"u"],"U0098":["Vehicle Communication Bus H (-) Low","Bus H low-side line voltage below expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to ground"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"u"],"U0099":["Vehicle Communication Bus H (-) High","Bus H low-side line voltage above expected range. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wire shorted to battery"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"u"],"U009A":["Vehicle Communication Bus H (-) shorted to Bus H (+)","Bus H lines shorted together. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Bus lines shorted together"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"u"],"U009B":["Vehicle Communication Bus I","Generic fault on bus I. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or node fault on bus I"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"u"],"U009C":["Vehicle Communication Bus I Performance","Bus I error counters or message rate out of spec. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring chafed or marginal"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"u"],"U009D":["Vehicle Communication Bus J","Generic fault on bus J. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or node fault on bus J"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"u"],"U009E":["Vehicle Communication Bus J Performance","Bus J error counters or message rate out of spec. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring chafed or marginal"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"u"],"U0100":["Lost Communication with ECM/PCM \"A\"","The ECM/PCM \"A\" has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. As this is the engine controller itself, the engine usually will not start or run while the message is missing.",[["h","ECM unpowered (fuse, ground, supply wire)"],["m","CAN wiring to ECM broken"],["l","ECM internally failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[50,2000]],"c"],"U0101":["Lost Communication with TCM","The ECU has stopped receiving messages from the transmission control module. The transmission falls into limp-home mode (typically locked in 3rd or 4th gear), the speedometer may stop working, and shift adaptation freezes.",[["h","TCM unpowered or grounded poorly"],["m","CAN wiring to TCM broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[50,2000]],"c"],"U0102":["Lost Communication with Transfer Case Control Module","The Transfer Case Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Four-wheel-drive range selection and torque distribution become unavailable.",[["h","Transfer case module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to transfer case module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0103":["Lost Communication with Gear Shift Module","The Gear Shift Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Shift-by-wire gear selection can fail and leave the transmission in a default position.",[["h","Shift module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to shift module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1800]],"c"],"U0104":["Lost Communication with Cruise Control Module","The Cruise Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Cruise control and speed-hold functions stop working.",[["h","Cruise module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to cruise module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0105":["Lost Communication with Fuel Injector Control Module","The Fuel Injector Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Injection-timing data is lost, which can stall the engine or prevent a start.",[["h","Injector control module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to FICM broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,2000]],"c"],"U0106":["Lost Communication with Glow Plug Control Module","The Glow Plug Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Cold-start pre-heating is no longer coordinated, causing hard diesel starts.",[["h","Glow plug module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to glow plug module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0107":["Lost Communication with Throttle Actuator Control Module","The Throttle Actuator Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Electronic throttle control can drop to limp mode with sharply reduced power.",[["h","Throttle module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to throttle module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0108":["Lost Communication With Alternative Fuel Control Module","The ECU has lost CAN communication with the alternative fuel control module (CNG/LPG/H2 systems). Either the module is not responding or the bus path is broken.",[["h","Module unpowered or fuse blown"],["m","CAN wiring to module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,1200]],"c"],"U0109":["Lost Communication with Fuel Pump Control Module","The Fuel Pump Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Fuel-delivery control is lost, which can starve the engine of fuel.",[["h","Fuel pump module unpowered (often a fuse or relay)"],["m","CAN wiring to FPCM broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U010A":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Recirculation Control Module A","ECU has lost CAN communication with the EGR control module A. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,1000]],"c"],"U010B":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Recirculation Control Module B","ECU has lost CAN communication with the EGR control module B. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,1000]],"c"],"U010C":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Control Module A","ECU has lost CAN communication with the turbocharger control module A. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U010D":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Control Module B","ECU has lost CAN communication with the turbocharger control module B. Boost control tracks commanded vs.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U010E":["Lost Communication With Reductant Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the AdBlue/SCR reductant control module. Emissions affected.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"c"],"U010F":["Lost Communication With Air Conditioning Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the A/C control module. Climate functions degraded.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,800]],"c"],"U0110":["Lost Communication with Drive Motor Control Module","The Drive Motor Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. On a hybrid or EV the electric drive can shut down or limit power.",[["h","Drive motor module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to drive motor module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3000]],"c"],"U0111":["Lost Communication with Battery Energy Control Module","The Battery Energy Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. High-voltage battery-management data is lost; the hybrid/EV system may disable the drive.",[["h","BMS unpowered (12 V supply)"],["m","CAN wiring to BMS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3500]],"c"],"U0112":["Lost Communication with Battery Energy Control Module \"B\"","The Battery Energy Control Module \"B\" has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The second battery-energy controller is silent, limiting high-voltage system availability.",[["h","BEM-B unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to BEM-B broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3000]],"c"],"U0114":["Lost Communication with 4WD Clutch Control Module","The 4WD Clutch Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Electronically controlled four-wheel-drive engagement is unavailable.",[["h","AWD clutch module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to AWD clutch module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0115":["Lost Communication with ECM/PCM \"B\"","The ECM/PCM \"B\" has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. A second engine/powertrain controller is unreachable, which can prevent the engine from running.",[["h","Secondary ECM unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to secondary ECM broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[50,2000]],"c"],"U0116":["Lost Communication with Steering Effort Control Module","The Steering Effort Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Speed-dependent steering assist is lost, changing the steering feel.",[["h","Steering effort module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to steering effort module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0117":["Lost Communication with Drive Motor Control Module 2","The Drive Motor Control Module 2 has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The second drive-motor controller is silent, limiting electric drive on that axle.",[["h","Secondary drive motor module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to secondary drive motor broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3500]],"c"],"U0119":["Lost Communication with Steering Column Control Module","The Steering Column Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Steering-column controls and the steering-lock function can fail.",[["h","Steering column module unpowered"],["m","Clockspring failed inside steering column"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U011A":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Sensor Module A","ECU lost CAN communication with exhaust gas sensor module A (often integrates wide-range O2/NOx sensors).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1200]],"c"],"U011B":["Lost Communication With Rocker Arm Control Module A","ECU lost CAN communication with rocker arm control module A (variable valve actuation). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1200]],"c"],"U011C":["Lost Communication With Rocker Arm Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with rocker arm control module B (variable valve actuation). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1200]],"c"],"U011D":["Lost Communication With All Wheel Drive Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the AWD control module. AWD function may revert to FWD/RWD.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"c"],"U011E":["Lost Communication With Throttle Actuator B Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with throttle actuator B control module. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,1500]],"u"],"U011F":["Lost Communication With V2X Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the V2X (vehicle-to-everything) module. Connected/cooperative driving features degraded.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1200]],"u"],"U0120":["Lost Communication with Starter/Generator Control Module","The Starter/Generator Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stop-start and mild-hybrid generator functions stop working.",[["h","Starter/generator module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to starter/generator broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,2500]],"c"],"U0121":["Lost Communication with ABS Control Module","The CAN messages from the ABS module are missing. ABS, ESP/ESC and traction control all become inactive (warning lamps illuminate), the speedometer may go to zero on cars that derive vehicle speed from the ABS module, and adaptive cruise control is disabled.",[["h","ABS module unpowered (often a corroded ground or fuse)"],["m","CAN wiring to ABS broken"],["m","ABS module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1800]],"c"],"U0122":["Lost Communication with Vehicle Dynamics Control Module","The Vehicle Dynamics Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stability control (ESC/ESP) is disabled, leaving the car without electronic stabilisation.",[["h","Vehicle dynamics module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to dynamics module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,2000]],"c"],"U0123":["Lost Communication with Yaw Rate Sensor Module","The Yaw Rate Sensor Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stability control loses its yaw input and typically disables ESC.",[["h","Yaw rate sensor unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to yaw rate sensor broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,900]],"c"],"U0124":["Lost Communication with Lateral Acceleration Sensor Module","The Lateral Acceleration Sensor Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stability and rollover functions lose their lateral-acceleration input.",[["h","Lateral acceleration sensor unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to lateral accel sensor broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"c"],"U0125":["Lost Communication with Multi-axis Acceleration Sensor","The Multi-axis Acceleration Sensor has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Several stability and airbag functions lose their motion reference.",[["h","Yaw sensor unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to yaw sensor broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"c"],"U0126":["Lost Communication with Steering Angle Sensor Module","The Steering Angle Sensor Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stability control loses the steering-angle reference and usually disables ESC.",[["h","Steering angle sensor unpowered"],["m","Clockspring (in steering column) failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,900]],"c"],"U0127":["Lost Communication with Tire Pressure Monitor Module","The Tire Pressure Monitor Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Tire-pressure monitoring stops and warns the driver.",[["h","TPMS module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to TPMS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,700]],"c"],"U0128":["Lost Communication with Park Brake Control Module","The Park Brake Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The electronic parking brake may not release or apply correctly.",[["h","EPB module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to EPB broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0129":["Lost Communication with Brake System Control Module","The Brake System Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. ABS and electronic brake functions are lost; base braking remains but the assists are off.",[["h","Brake module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to brake module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,2000]],"c"],"U012A":["Lost Communication With Chassis Control Module A","ECU lost CAN communication with chassis control module A (vehicle dynamics). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U012B":["Lost Communication With Chassis Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with chassis control module B (vehicle dynamics). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U012C":["Lost Communication With Active Vibration Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with active vibration control module (used in some hybrid drivetrains to dampen vibrations).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U012D":["Lost Communication With Generator A Control Module","Lost Communication With Generator A Control Module: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U012E":["Lost Communication With Camshaft Position Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with camshaft position control module. The camshaft position sensor identifies which cylinder is on the compression stroke — without it the ECM cannot run sequential injection or coil-on-plug ignition correctly.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U012F":["Lost Communication With Generator B Control Module","Lost Communication With Generator B Control Module: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1500]],"u"],"U0130":["Lost Communication with Steering Effort Control Module B","The Steering Effort Control Module B has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The secondary steering-assist controller is unreachable, affecting power steering.",[["h","Secondary steering effort module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to secondary steering effort broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,2000]],"c"],"U0131":["Lost Communication with Power Steering Control Module","The Power Steering Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Electric power steering can fail, requiring much higher steering effort.",[["h","EPS module unpowered (large fuse on battery)"],["m","CAN wiring to EPS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,2000]],"c"],"U0132":["Lost Communication with Ride Level Control Module","The Ride Level Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Air or electronic suspension levelling stops working.",[["h","Air suspension module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to air suspension broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,2500]],"c"],"U0133":["Lost Communication with Yaw Rate Sensor Module","The ESP / ABS controller has lost messages from the yaw-rate sensor module. ESP is deactivated, ABS may stay active.",[["h","Yaw rate sensor module failed"],["m","Sensor wiring or connector damaged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,900]],"c"],"U0135":["Lost Communication with Parking Brake Control Module","The vehicle network has lost the electric parking brake (EPB) controller. Auto-hold is disabled, the EPB warning lamp comes on.",[["h","EPB module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to EPB damaged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0137":["Lost Communication with Trailer Brake Control Module","The vehicle network has lost the integrated trailer brake controller. Trailer braking falls back to passive operation; trailer-related warnings appear in the cluster.",[["h","Trailer module unpowered or fuse blown"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,600]],"c"],"U0138":["Lost Communication with All Terrain Control Module","The terrain mode / 4WD mode controller has dropped off the bus. Off-road and traction modes can no longer be selected; vehicle defaults to standard 2WD/AWD behaviour.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[60,600]],"c"],"U0139":["Lost Communication with Active Roll Control Module","The active anti-roll bar / dynamic chassis controller has dropped off the bus. The vehicle behaves as if the system is disabled; rolling motion is not actively counteracted.",[["h","Active roll module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U013C":["Lost Communication With Accelerator Pedal Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the accelerator pedal module. Throttle response severely affected.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,1000]],"u"],"U013D":["Lost Communication With Vacuum Sensor A","ECU lost CAN communication with vacuum sensor A (often a smart sensor with bus interface). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Sensor unpowered or bus connection broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"u"],"U013E":["Lost Communication With Vacuum Sensor B","ECU lost CAN communication with vacuum sensor B (often a smart sensor with bus interface). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Sensor unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"u"],"U013F":["Lost Communication With Pedestrian Alert Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the pedestrian alert (acoustic vehicle alerting) module — required by law on EVs/hybrids at low speed.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"u"],"U0140":["Lost Communication with Body Control Module","CAN messages from the body control module (BCM) are missing. Effects depend on what the BCM controls — typically interior lights, wipers, central locking, immobiliser handshake.",[["h","BCM unpowered"],["m","Water ingress into BCM (often footwell-mounted)"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0141":["Lost Communication with Body Control Module A","A second body control module (BCM \"A\") has dropped off the bus. Several comfort, lighting and locking functions stop working until the BCM is back online.",[["h","BCM A unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to BCM A broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0142":["Lost Communication with Body Control Module B","The Body Control Module B has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. A second body controller is silent; lighting, locks, or comfort functions can fail.",[["h","Secondary BCM unpowered"],["m","Water ingress into rear BCM"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0143":["Lost Communication with Body Control Module C","A third body control module (BCM \"C\") has dropped off the bus. Comfort, lighting or door functions on the affected zone stop working.",[["h","BCM C unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0145":["Lost Communication with Restraints Control Module Auxiliary","A secondary or auxiliary airbag/restraints controller (e.g. for rear or curtain bags) has stopped responding.",[["m","Auxiliary restraint module failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,1500]],"c"],"U0146":["Lost Communication with Gateway \"A\"","Lost Communication with Gateway \"A\": the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Gateway unpowered (often a fuse on the central electronics)"],["m","Gateway internally failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,2000]],"c"],"U0147":["Lost Communication with Gateway \"B\"","Lost Communication with Gateway \"B\": the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Secondary gateway unpowered"],["m","Secondary gateway internally failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,2000]],"c"],"U0148":["Lost Communication with Body Control Module \"C\"","The Body Control Module \"C\" has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. A third body controller is unreachable; its assigned body functions are affected.",[["h","BCM-C unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to BCM-C broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U014A":["Lost Communication With Battery Energy Control Module C","ECU lost CAN communication with battery energy control module C (hybrid/EV high-voltage battery management).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2500]],"u"],"U014B":["Lost Communication With Hybrid/EV Battery Inductive Charging Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the inductive charging module (wireless charging of HV battery). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U014C":["Lost Communication With Battery Energy Control Module D","ECU lost CAN communication with battery energy control module D (hybrid/EV high-voltage battery management).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2500]],"u"],"U014D":["Lost Communication with Mirror Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with mirror control module B. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[50,500]],"u"],"U014E":["Lost Communication With Multi-axis Acceleration Sensor Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with multi-axis acceleration sensor module B (used by stability and airbag systems).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1000]],"u"],"U0151":["Lost Communication with Restraints Control Module","The Restraints Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The airbag/restraints controller is unreachable — airbags and belt tensioners may not deploy.",[["h","SRS module unpowered (often water damage under seat)"],["m","CAN wiring to SRS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,2000]],"c"],"U0152":["Lost Communication with Side Restraints Control Module Left","The Side Restraints Control Module Left has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Left-side airbags may not deploy in a crash.",[["h","Side SRS module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to side SRS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,1800]],"c"],"U0153":["Lost Communication with Restraints Control Module B","The Restraints Control Module B has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. A second restraints controller is unreachable, affecting airbag readiness.",[["h","Secondary SRS module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to secondary SRS broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,1800]],"c"],"U0154":["Lost Communication with Restraints Occupant Sensing Module","The Restraints Occupant Sensing Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Occupant detection is lost, so airbag suppression and staging may be wrong.",[["h","Occupant sensing module unpowered"],["m","Seat harness damaged under the seat"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[150,1500]],"c"],"U0155":["Lost Communication with Instrument Panel Cluster","CAN messages from or to the instrument cluster are missing. The cluster is the user-facing interface — speedometer, tachometer, warning lamps, fuel level, odometer — so failure is immediately visible.",[["h","Cluster unpowered or fuse blown"],["m","Cluster internal failure (common on aged TFTs)"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1500]],"c"],"U0156":["Lost Communication with Information Center \"A\"","The Information Center \"A\" has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The driver-information display loses data and may go blank.",[["h","Head unit unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to head unit broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0157":["Lost Communication with Personalization Control Module","The Personalization Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Stored personalisation settings are not loaded.",[["h","Personalization module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to personalization module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"c"],"U0158":["Lost Communication with Head Up Display","The Head Up Display has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The head-up display stops showing information.",[["h","HUD module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to HUD broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0159":["Lost Communication with Parking Assist Module","The Parking Assist Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Parking sensors and park-assist functions stop working.",[["h","PDC module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to PDC broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"c"],"U015A":["Lost Communication With Anti-Lock Brake System (ABS) Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with the secondary ABS control module B. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U015B":["Lost Communication With Power Steering Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with power steering control module B. Steering assist may be reduced.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U015C":["Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Control Module A","Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Control Module A: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[300,3000]],"u"],"U015D":["Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Control Module B","Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Control Module B: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[300,3000]],"u"],"U015E":["Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Interface Module A","ECU lost CAN communication with ADS interface module A (interface between automated driving compute and vehicle subsystems).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2500]],"u"],"U015F":["Lost Communication With Automated Driving System Interface Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with ADS interface module B (interface between automated driving compute and vehicle subsystems).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2500]],"u"],"U0160":["Lost Communication with Audible Alert Control Module","The Audible Alert Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Chimes and warning buzzers may not sound.",[["h","Chime module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to chime module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,600]],"c"],"U0161":["Lost Communication with Compass Module","The Compass Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The compass and heading display loses its data.",[["h","Compass module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to compass module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"c"],"U0162":["Lost Communication with Navigation Display Module","The Navigation Display Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The navigation screen loses its display feed.",[["h","Navigation display unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to navigation display broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0163":["Lost Communication with Navigation Control Module","The Navigation Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Navigation and route guidance stop working.",[["h","Navigation module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to navigation module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[100,2000]],"c"],"U0164":["Lost Communication with HVAC Control Module","The HVAC Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Automatic climate control stops responding.",[["h","HVAC module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to HVAC module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0165":["Lost Communication with Auxiliary HVAC Control Module","The Auxiliary HVAC Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Rear or auxiliary climate control stops working.",[["h","Auxiliary HVAC module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to auxiliary HVAC broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1000]],"c"],"U0166":["Lost Communication with Auxiliary Heater Control Module","The Auxiliary Heater Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The auxiliary or parking-heater control is lost.",[["h","Auxiliary heater unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to auxiliary heater broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0167":["Lost Communication with Vehicle Immobiliser Control Module","The Vehicle Immobiliser Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Immobiliser authorisation can fail, preventing engine start.",[["h","Immobiliser module unpowered"],["m","Immobiliser antenna ring failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1800]],"c"],"U0168":["Lost Communication with Vehicle Immobilizer Control Module","The ECU cannot reach the immobilizer / vehicle security module. Engine start is usually blocked because the rolling code cannot be exchanged.",[["h","Immobilizer module unpowered"],["m","Wiring or antenna ring damaged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,900]],"c"],"U0169":["Lost Communication with Sun Roof Control Module","The Sun Roof Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Powered sunroof operation stops working.",[["h","Sunroof module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to sunroof module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,900]],"c"],"U016A":["Lost Communication With Global Positioning System Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the GPS module. Position-dependent functions (navigation, geofencing) degraded.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,600]],"c"],"U016B":["Lost Communication With A/C Compressor Control Module","ECU lost CAN communication with the A/C compressor control module (electric A/C compressor on hybrids/EVs).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1500]],"u"],"U016C":["Lost Communication With Fuel Pump Control Module B","ECU lost CAN communication with fuel pump control module B. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module r