nto limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1200]],"c"],"U017E":["Lost Communication With Seat Belt Pretensioner Module A","ECU lost communication with seat belt pretensioner module A. Pretensioner function may be unavailable in a crash.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1500]],"c"],"U017F":["Lost Communication With Seat Belt Pretensioner Module B","ECU lost communication with seat belt pretensioner module B. Pretensioner function may be unavailable in a crash.",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1500]],"c"],"U0180":["Lost Communication with Automatic Lighting Control Module","The Automatic Lighting Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Automatic exterior lighting (auto headlamps) stops working.",[["h","Headlamp control module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to headlamp module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1200]],"c"],"U0182":["Lost Communication with Headlamp Leveling Control Module","The vehicle network has lost the headlamp leveling controller. Automatic leveling is disabled and the lamps stay in a default position; on many vehicles the headlight warning comes on.",[["h","Leveling module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"c"],"U0183":["Lost Communication with Sunroof Control Module","The body controller has lost the sunroof / panorama roof module. The roof can no longer be operated electrically and pinch protection is unavailable.",[["h","Water ingress in sunroof module"],["m","LIN wire to sunroof damaged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,700]],"c"],"U0184":["Lost Communication with Radio","The Radio has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The radio/head unit drops off the bus and may go silent.",[["h","Radio unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to radio broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,1200]],"c"],"U0185":["Lost Communication with Antenna Control Module","The infotainment system has lost the antenna / tuner amplifier controller. Radio reception drops, navigation may lose GPS, and connected services can fail.",[["h","Antenna module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,600]],"c"],"U0186":["Lost Communication with Audio Amplifier","The Audio Amplifier has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The external audio amplifier stops producing sound.",[["h","Amplifier unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to amplifier broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,1500]],"c"],"U0187":["Lost Communication with Disc Player Module","The Disc Player Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The CD/DVD player is unreachable.",[["h","Disc player unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to disc player broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,600]],"c"],"U0188":["Lost Communication with Audio Rear Control Module","The Audio Rear Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Rear-seat audio controls stop working.",[["h","Rear audio module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to rear audio module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,600]],"c"],"U0189":["Lost Communication with Auxiliary Heater Control Module","The HVAC controller has lost the auxiliary fuel-fired heater module. Pre-heating cannot be commanded; the heater stays inactive.",[["h","Auxiliary heater unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,700]],"c"],"U018A":["Lost Communication With Headlamp Leveling Control Module B","ECU lost communication with headlamp leveling control module B (auto-levelling for HID/LED headlamps).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[60,400]],"u"],"U0191":["Lost Communication with Television Tuner Module","The Television Tuner Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. The TV tuner is unreachable.",[["h","TV tuner unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to TV tuner broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,600]],"c"],"U0192":["Lost Communication with Personal Computer","The vehicle gateway has lost the on-board computer / fleet telematics PC. Logging, fleet management or driver-assistance based on the PC stop working.",[["h","PC unpowered or hung"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"c"],"U0193":["Lost Communication with Mobile Phone Module","The Mobile Phone Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Hands-free phone integration stops working.",[["h","Phone module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to phone module broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,800]],"c"],"U0194":["Lost Communication with Personal Assist Module","The infotainment bus has lost the voice assistant / personal assist module. Voice commands and connected concierge features stop working.",[["h","Assist module unpowered or hung"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"c"],"U0195":["Lost Communication with Satellite Radio Receiver Module","The Satellite Radio Receiver Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Satellite-radio reception is lost.",[["h","Satellite radio module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to satellite radio broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,600]],"c"],"U0196":["Lost Communication with Rear Seat Entertainment Control Module","The Rear Seat Entertainment Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. Rear-seat entertainment stops working.",[["h","RSE module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to RSE broken"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,800]],"c"],"U0197":["Lost Communication with Hands-Free Phone Control Module","The infotainment system cannot reach the hands-free phone controller. Bluetooth telephony, address book sync and emergency call features may be unavailable.",[["h","Hands-free module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,500]],"c"],"U0198":["Lost Communication with Telematic Control Module","The vehicle has lost the telematics module (eCall / Connected Services / TCU). Emergency call, remote services and over-the-air features are unavailable until the module is back online.",[["h","TCU unpowered or backup battery dead"],["l","Mobile antenna disconnected"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,1200]],"c"],"U0199":["Lost Communication with Door Control Module","The Door Control Module has stopped transmitting on the vehicle data bus, so other control units no longer receive its messages. A door control module is silent; its window, lock, and mirror controls fail.",[["h","Door module unpowered (often broken wires in door hinge)"],["m","Water ingress into door module"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"c"],"U019A":["Lost Communication With Tachograph Module","ECU lost communication with the tachograph module (commercial vehicle driving-time recorder, EU regulation).",[["h","Module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U019B":["Lost Communication With Battery Charger Control Module A","