controlled by this node default to a fixed position.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1500]],"u"],"U0290":["Lost Communication With Active Aerodynamic Feature Control Module D","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with active aerodynamic feature module D. Powered spoilers, air-dams or wheel-arch closures controlled by this node default to a fixed position.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1500]],"u"],"U0291":["Lost Communication With Gear Shift Control Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with gear shift control module B. Shift-by-wire requests for park/reverse/drive coordinated through this node are no longer answered.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"c"],"U0292":["Lost Communication With Drive Motor Control Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with drive motor control module B. Torque commands for the second EV/hybrid traction motor cannot be coordinated, forcing the powertrain into a degraded mode.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3500]],"c"],"U0293":["Lost Communication with Hybrid Vehicle Control System","The hybrid vehicle network has lost the hybrid control unit (HCU). The vehicle drops out of hybrid operation, often forced into a fail-safe mode that limits torque.",[["h","HCU unpowered"],["m","HV interlock loop opened"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3000]],"c"],"U0294":["Lost Communication with Powertrain Control Module B","A second powertrain control module (e.g. on dual-engine, twin-turbo bank-specific or range-extender vehicles) has dropped off the network.",[["h","PCM B unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1800]],"c"],"U0295":["Lost Communication with Power Steering Control Module","The vehicle network has lost the electric power steering (EPS) control module. Power assist drops out, the steering becomes heavy and the EPS warning lamp lights up.",[["h","EPS module unpowered"],["m","CAN wiring to EPS damaged"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[120,1500]],"c"],"U0296":["Lost Communication With AC/DC Converter Control Module A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with AC/DC converter (on-board charger) module A. Charging from AC sources cannot be controlled and the high-voltage battery does not refill via this path.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3000]],"c"],"U0297":["Lost Communication with Hybrid Powertrain Control Module","The hybrid CAN has lost the hybrid powertrain control module. Hybrid operation is disabled and the vehicle defaults to combustion-only mode if available.",[["h","Hybrid module unpowered"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,3000]],"c"],"U0298":["Lost Communication With DC/DC Converter Control Module A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with DC/DC converter module A. The converter that supplies the 12-V system from the high-voltage battery cannot be commanded; 12-V load shedding may begin.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,2500]],"c"],"U0299":["Lost Communication With DC/DC Converter Control Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with DC/DC converter module B. The converter that supplies the 12-V system from the high-voltage battery cannot be commanded; 12-V load shedding may begin.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,2500]],"c"],"U029A":["Lost Communication With Hybrid/EV Battery Pack Sensor Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the high-voltage battery pack sensor module. Cell-voltage and temperature data needed for state-of-charge and state-of-health calculation are missing.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3000]],"c"],"U029B":["Lost Communication With Drive Motor Control Module C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with drive motor control module C. Torque commands for this EV/hybrid traction motor cannot be coordinated, forcing the powertrain into a degraded mode.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3500]],"c"],"U029C":["Lost Communication With Drive Motor Control Module D","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with drive motor control module D. Torque commands for this EV/hybrid traction motor cannot be coordinated, forcing the powertrain into a degraded mode.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3500]],"c"],"U029D":["Lost Communication With NOx Sensor A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with NOx sensor A (smart sensor with own ECU). The SCR catalyst control loop loses its actual NOx feedback and may switch to substitute values.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[350,1800]],"c"],"U029E":["Lost Communication With NOx Sensor B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with NOx sensor B (smart sensor with own ECU). The SCR catalyst control loop loses its actual NOx feedback and may switch to substitute values.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[350,1800]],"c"],"U029F":["Lost Communication With Evaporative Emission System Leak Detection Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the EVAP leak detection module. Tank-pressure / vacuum diagnostics for fuel-vapour leaks cannot be commanded.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U02A0":["Invalid Data Received From Hybrid/EV Battery Interface Control Module D","A receiving module detected implausible data from hybrid/EV battery interface module D. Cell-voltage, current or temperature values fail plausibility checks against other inputs and are rejected.",[["h","Module internal fault or sensor input drift"],["m","Software version mismatch after replacement"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2500]],"u"],"U02A1":["Lost Communication With NOx Sensor C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with NOx sensor C (smart sensor with own ECU). The SCR catalyst control loop loses its actual NOx feedback and may switch to substitute values.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[350,1800]],"u"],"U02A2":["Lost Communication With Reductant Quality Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the reductant (DEF/AdBlue) quality sensor module. The SCR system cannot verify urea concentration; emissions countermeasures may activate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U02A3":["Lost Communication With Particulate Matter Sensor","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the particulate matter (PM) sensor (smart sensor with own ECU). DPF post-cat soot monitoring loses its primary feedback signal.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1500]],"u"],"U02A4":["Lost Communication With NH3 Sensor","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the ammonia (NH3) slip sensor downstream of the SCR. Detection of urea over-dosing is impaired.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1500]],"u"],"U02A5":["Lost Communication With Reductant Heater Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the reductant heater module. AdBlue lines and tank can no longer be thawed at low temperatures, blocking SCR operation in winter.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1200]],"u"],"U02A6":["Lost Communication With Safety Integration Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the safety integration module that arbitrates between ADAS, restraint, brake and steering systems. Cross-system safety functions may be inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U02A7":["Lost Communication With Engine Sound Control 1","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with engine sound control unit 1. Active sound design (interior synthetic engine sound or exterior pedestrian alert) for this channel stops.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"u"],"U02A8":["Lost Communication With Engine Sound Control 2","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with engine sound control unit 2. Active sound design (interior synthetic engine sound or exterior pedestrian alert) for this channel stops.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,800]],"u"],"U02A9":["Lost Communication With Charge Air Cooler Coolant Pump A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with charge air cooler (intercooler) coolant pump A. Intake-charge cooling on indirect intercooler systems cannot be controlled, raising knock risk and reducing power.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1200]],"u"],"U02AA":["Lost Communication With Engine Disconnect Clutch","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the hybrid engine disconnect clutch actuator. Switching between EV-only and combustion drive can no longer be commanded smoothly.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,3500]],"u"],"U02AB":["Lost Communication With Vehicle Thermal Management Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the vehicle thermal management module. Coordination of engine, battery and cabin cooling/heating loops is lost; sub-modules fall back to local control.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,1800]],"u"],"U02AC":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Boost Control A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with boost control module A (electric wastegate or VTG actuator). Boost pressure cannot be commanded; the engine reverts to a low-power fallback.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[300,2500]],"u"],"U02AD":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Boost Control B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with boost control module B (electric wastegate or VTG actuator). Boost pressure cannot be commanded; the engine reverts to a low-power fallback.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[300,2500]],"u"],"U02AE":["Lost Communication With Hybrid/EV Battery Coolant Pump","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the high-voltage battery coolant pump. Active battery cooling cannot be regulated; charging/discharging power may be limited to protect the cells.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U02AF":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger Turbine Inlet Valve Position Sensor","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the turbocharger turbine inlet valve position sensor. Position feedback for variable inlet geometry on twin-scroll/sequential turbo systems is missing.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U02B0":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Boost Control B Position Sensor","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the boost control B position sensor. Closed-loop control of the wastegate/VTG actuator on this turbo loses its actual feedback signal.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[200,2000]],"u"],"U02B1":["Lost Communication With Comfort and Convenience Display A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with comfort and convenience display A (typically a rear-seat or passenger screen for climate, audio, ambient lighting). It freezes or goes blank.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1500]],"u"],"U02B2":["Lost Communication With Comfort and Convenience Display B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with comfort and convenience display B (typically a rear-seat or passenger screen for climate, audio, ambient lighting). It freezes or goes blank.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1500]],"u"],"U02B3":["Lost Communication With Driver Monitoring System Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the driver monitoring system (DMS) module. Eye/head-pose tracking for drowsiness, distraction and hands-on detection is unavailable, and dependent ADAS handover features may be inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1800]],"u"],"U02B4":["Lost Communication With Front Radar Module A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with front radar module A. Adaptive cruise control, automatic emergency braking and forward collision warning lose their primary range/closing-speed input.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,2500]],"u"],"U02B5":["Lost Communication With Front Radar Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with front radar module B. Adaptive cruise control, automatic emergency braking and forward collision warning lose their primary range/closing-speed input.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,2500]],"u"],"U02B6":["Lost Communication With Rear Radar Module A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with rear radar module A. Blind-spot warning, lane-change assist and rear cross-traffic alert dependent on this sensor are inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1800]],"u"],"U02B7":["Lost Communication With Rear Radar Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with rear radar module B. Blind-spot warning, lane-change assist and rear cross-traffic alert dependent on this sensor are inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1800]],"u"],"U02B8":["Lost Communication With Rear Radar Module C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with rear radar module C. Blind-spot warning, lane-change assist and rear cross-traffic alert dependent on this sensor are inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1800]],"u"],"U02B9":["Lost Communication With Rear Radar Module D","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with rear radar module D. Blind-spot warning, lane-change assist and rear cross-traffic alert dependent on this sensor are inhibited.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,1800]],"u"],"U02BA":["Lost Communication With Hybrid/EV Electronics Coolant Pump B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the hybrid/EV power-electronics coolant pump B. Inverters and DC/DC stages on this loop lose active cooling and may derate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U02BB":["Lost Communication With EVAP System Purge Pump","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the EVAP purge pump (used on systems with electric purging instead of intake-vacuum). Vapour purge from the carbon canister cannot be commanded.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,800]],"u"],"U02BC":["Lost Communication With Localization and Mapping Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the localization and mapping module (HD map / SLAM ECU for ADAS and autonomous functions). Lane-level localization and map-based predictions are unavailable.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[400,2500]],"u"],"U02BD":["Lost Communication With Night Vision Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the night vision module. The infrared camera image and pedestrian highlighting in the head-up or cluster display are unavailable.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[300,2500]],"u"],"U02BE":["Lost Communication With Trailer Backup Assist Control Module","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the trailer backup assist module. Steer-by-knob trailer reverse guidance, hitch angle sensing and trajectory planning are unavailable.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U02BF":["Lost Communication With Interior Lighting Control Module B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with interior lighting control module B. Ambient lighting zones, reading lamps and door courtesy lights driven by this node fall back to a default state.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[50,500]],"u"],"U02C0":["Lost Communication With Active Radiator Air Flow Control Module A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with active radiator air flow control module A. Active grille shutters and electric cooling-fan staging on this circuit cannot be commanded.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1200]],"u"],"U02C1":["Lost Communication With Hybrid/EV Electronics Coolant Pump C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with the hybrid/EV power-electronics coolant pump C. Inverters and DC/DC stages on this loop lose active cooling and may derate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U0300":["Internal Control Module Software Incompatibility","A control module has detected that its software version is incompatible with another module on the bus. Most often after a partial update, mismatched coding, or fitting a used module from a different vehicle.",[["h","Software/calibration mismatch between modules"],["m","Used module from different vehicle fitted"],["m","Incomplete or interrupted module flash"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0301":["Software Incompatibility with ECM/PCM","A control module has detected that its software/calibration is incompatible with the engine ECM/PCM. Typically appears after a partial flash, mismatched coding, or fitting a used ECM from a different vehicle.",[["h","Software/calibration mismatch with ECM"],["m","Used ECM from different vehicle fitted"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0302":["Software Incompatibility with TCM","A control module has detected that its software/calibration is incompatible with the transmission control module. Often appears after a TCM swap or partial flash.",[["h","Software/calibration mismatch with TCM"],["m","Used TCM from different vehicle fitted"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0303":["Software Incompatibility with Transfer Case Control Module","A control module has detected that its software/calibration is incompatible with the transfer case control module. AWD/4WD modes may not work correctly until matching software is flashed.",[["h","Software/calibration mismatch with transfer case"],["m","Used transfer case module from different vehicle fitted"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,800]],"c"],"U0305":["Software Incompatibility with Cruise Control Module","A control module has detected that its software/calibration is incompatible with the cruise control module. Cruise control may be disabled until matching software is flashed.",[["h","Software/calibration mismatch with cruise module"],["m","Used cruise module from different vehicle fitted"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,600]],"c"],"U0306":["Software Incompatibility with Fuel Injector Control Module","The injector driver module identifies itself with a software version that does not match what the engine ECU expects. Engine may not start or runs roughly until both modules are reflashed to compatible versions.",[["h","Software flash incomplete or wrong file"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,600]],"c"],"U0307":["Software Incompatibility with Glow Plug Control Module","The glow plug controller and the engine ECU run incompatible software versions. Cold-start preheating may be inhibited and the glow plug warning lamp can stay on.",[["h","Software flash mismatch after parts swap"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,500]],"c"],"U0308":["Software Incompatibility with Body Control Module","The BCM software does not match what other vehicle modules expect. Comfort or lighting features can behave erratically until reflashing or coding is performed.",[["h","Incompatible flash after BCM swap"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[100,600]],"c"],"U0309":["Software Incompatibility With Alternative Fuel Control Module","A module reports a software version mismatch with the alternative fuel (CNG/LPG/H2) control module — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"c"],"U030A":["Software Incompatibility With Evaporative Emission System Leak Detection Control Module","A module reports a software version mismatch with the EVAP leak detection module — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U030B":["Software Incompatibility With Glow Plug Control Module 2","A module reports a software version mismatch with glow plug control module 2 — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U030C":["Software Incompatibility With Reductant Quality Module","A module reports a software version mismatch with the reductant quality module — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U030D":["Software Incompatibility With NOx Sensor A","A module reports a software version mismatch with NOx sensor A (smart sensor with own ECU) — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U030E":["Software Incompatibility With NOx Sensor B","A module reports a software version mismatch with NOx sensor B (smart sensor with own ECU) — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U030F":["Software Incompatibility With Reductant Control Module","A module reports a software version mismatch with the reductant control module — typically after replacing one of the modules without programming the new unit to match the rest of the network.",[["h","Module replaced without programming"],["m","Wrong part number for the vehicle"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"u"],"U0310":["Software Incompatibility With Fuel Pump Control Module","A module reports a software version mismatch with the fuel pump control module — typicall