ternal software version is inconsistent — for example a partial flash that left the module with mismatched calibration and program code. The module may go offline or operate in a fallback mode.",[["h","Incomplete or interrupted module flash"],["m","Corrupted calibration block"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[80,1500]],"u"],"U0602":["Lost Communication With Particulate Filter Pressure Sensor B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart particulate filter (DPF) differential pressure sensor B. The ECM cannot read soot loading via this channel and may switch to a model-based estimate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0603":["Lost Communication With Fuel Pressure Sensor A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart fuel pressure sensor A (typically common-rail or low-pressure side). The ECM loses its actual rail-pressure feedback for closed-loop control.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1000]],"u"],"U0604":["Lost Communication With Fuel Pressure Sensor B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart fuel pressure sensor B (typically common-rail or low-pressure side). The ECM loses its actual rail-pressure feedback for closed-loop control.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[150,1000]],"u"],"U0605":["Lost Communication With A/C Refrigerant Sensor A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart A/C refrigerant sensor A. Pressure or composition feedback for the refrigeration loop is unavailable; A/C may default to off.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0606":["Lost Communication With Throttle/Pedal Position Sensor/Switch A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart throttle/pedal position sensor A. The ECM loses one of the redundant pedal channels and reverts to a fail-safe pedal map.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0607":["Lost Communication With Throttle/Pedal Position Sensor/Switch B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart throttle/pedal position sensor B. The ECM loses one of the redundant pedal channels and reverts to a fail-safe pedal map.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0608":["Lost Communication With Throttle/Pedal Position Sensor/Switch C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart throttle/pedal position sensor C. The ECM loses one of the redundant pedal channels and reverts to a fail-safe pedal map.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0609":["Lost Communication With Manifold Absolute Pressure/Barometric Pressure Sensor","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart MAP/BARO sensor. Without these inputs, ECM load and altitude correction switch to fallback values.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,600]],"u"],"U060A":["Lost Communication With Manifold Absolute Pressure Sensor B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart MAP sensor B. Engine load calculation switches to a fallback model based on MAF and RPM.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[80,600]],"u"],"U060B":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Boost Sensor A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart boost pressure sensor A. The boost-control loop loses its actual feedback and reverts to an open-loop fallback that limits boost.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U060C":["Lost Communication With Turbocharger/Supercharger Boost Sensor B","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart boost pressure sensor B. The boost-control loop loses its actual feedback 