ic functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0620":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 1 Sensor 2","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 1 sensor 2 (typically post-cat). Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0621":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 2 Sensor 1","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 2 sensor 1 (typically pre-cat). Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0622":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 2 Sensor 2","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 2 sensor 2 (typically post-cat). Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0623":["Lost Communication With Coolant Pump A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart coolant pump A (electric water pump). Pump speed cannot be commanded; coolant flow falls back to a default duty.",[["h","Bus wir