ressure Sensor D","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart DPF differential pressure sensor D. The ECM cannot read soot loading via this channel and may switch to a model-based estimate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0698":["Lost Communication With Coolant Pump E","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart coolant pump E (electric water pump). Pump speed cannot be commanded; coolant flow falls back to a default duty.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U0699":["Lost Communication With Coolant Pump F","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart coolant pump F (electric water pump). Pump speed cannot be commanded; coolant flow falls back to a default duty.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U069A":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 1 Sensor 3","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 1 sensor 3. Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U069B":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 1 Sensor 4","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 1 sensor 4. Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U069C":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 2 Sensor 3","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 2 sensor 3. Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U069D":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Gas Temperature Sensor Bank 2 Sensor 4","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust gas temperature sensor bank 2 sensor 4. Catalyst protection and DPF regeneration logic switch to model-based estimates.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U069E":["Lost Communication With Coolant Heater A","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart coolant heater A (PTC or fuel-fired booster). Cabin/coolant warm-up assistance cannot be commanded.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,2000]],"u"],"U069F":["Lost Communication With Exhaust Pressure Sensor C","The vehicle bus reports loss of communication with smart exhaust pressure sensor C. Pressure-based diagnostics switch to a model-based estimate.",[["h","Bus wiring open or shorted"],["m","Module without power or ground"],["m","Module failed"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,800]],"u"],"U0901":["Invalid Data from Ion Sense Module","A receiving module detected implausible data from the ion sense module (used for misfire/knock detection via ionisation current at the spark plug). Per-cylinder ion current values fail plausibility checks and are rejected.",[["h","Module internal fault or sensor input drift"],["m","Software version mismatch after replacement"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[120,1200]],"u"],"U3000":["Control Module","Generic fault on the control module itself — internal self-diagnostic flagged a problem with computation, memory, drivers or other internal subsystems.",[["h","Module internal fault"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["hard",[300,2500]],"u"],"U3001":["Control Module Improper Shutdown Performance","The control module did not complete its shutdown sequence cleanly — power was lost before housekeeping (saving learned values, freeze frames, adaptations) finished.",[["h","Power supply lost before shutdown completed"],["m","Bad ground connection"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"c"],"U3002":["Vehicle Identification Number","The control module reports a problem with the stored Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) — missing, mismatched between modules, or invalid format.",[["h","VIN mismatch after module replacement"],["m","VIN not programmed in replacement module"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,400]],"c"],"U3003":["Battery Voltage","The control module detected battery voltage outside its acceptable operating window. Either too low (drained battery, weak charging) or too high (charging system overvoltage).",[["h","Battery aged or sulfated"],["m","Alternator regulator fault (over- or undervoltage)"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[80,600]],"u"],"U3004":["Accessory Power Relay","Fault on the accessory power relay that switches power to comfort/accessory loads (radio, infotainment, etc.) when the key is in ACC position.",[["h","Relay contacts failed or coil open"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[20,200]],"c"],"U3005":["Retained Accessory Power","Fault on the retained accessory power (RAP) function that keeps comfort loads (windows, radio) powered for a short time after the key is removed.",[["h","RAP relay or BCM logic failed"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[50,500]],"c"],"U3006":["Control Module Input Power A Circuit/Open","Open circuit on the input power line A of the control module. The module is missing or losing its main supply on this rail.",[["h","Supply fuse blown"],["m","Power wiring break"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[10,300]],"c"],"U3007":["Control Module Input Power B Circuit/Open","Open circuit on input power line B of the control module (second supply rail, e.g. permanent +12V vs switched battery feed).",[["h","Supply fuse blown"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[10,300]],"c"],"U3008":["Control Module Ground A","Control Module Ground A: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Ground stud corroded"],["m","Ground connection loose"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[10,200]],"c"],"U3009":["Control Module Ground B","Control Module Ground B: the control module has detected this fault condition.",[["h","Ground stud corroded"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["easy",[10,200]],"c"],"U300A":["Ignition Switch","The control module detects an inconsistent or implausible ignition switch state — multiple positions reported simultaneously, or the position contradicts other inputs.",[["h","Ignition switch contacts worn"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[60,400]],"u"],"U300B":["Ignition Input Accessory/On/Start","Fault on the combined ACC/ON/START ignition input line of the control module. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or connector fault"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U300C":["Ignition Input Off/On/Start","Fault on the OFF/ON/START ignition input line. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or connector fault"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U300D":["Ignition Input On/Start","Fault on the ON/START ignition input line — module sees inconsistent ON or START signal. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Wiring or connector fault"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U300E":["Ignition Input On","Fault on the ignition ON input — module does not see ON state when other inputs say ON, or vice versa.",[["h","Ignition switch contacts worn"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U300F":["Ignition Input Accessory","Fault on the ignition ACC (accessory) input. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Ignition switch contacts worn"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U3010":["Ignition Input Start","Fault on the ignition START input — module does not see start request when cranking, or sees one when not cranking.",[["h","Start position contacts worn"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U3011":["Ignition Input Off","Fault on the ignition OFF input — module does not detect OFF state correctly. A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Ignition switch contacts worn"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[40,400]],"c"],"U3012":["Control Module Improper Wake-up Performance","The control module did not wake up cleanly from sleep mode — wake event timing or sequence outside spec.",[["h","Module internal fault"],["m","Wake signal noise or glitch"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[200,1500]],"u"],"U3013":["Control Module Input Power C Circuit/Open","Open circuit on input power line C of the control module (third supply rail, e.g. for redundant power on safety-critical modules).",[["h","Supply fuse blown"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","CAN terminating resistor (120 Ω) drifted out of spec"]],["Multiple warning lights may illuminate","Affected modules may go into limp mode or shut down","Specific functions inoperative depending on module"],["medium",[10,300]],"u"],"U3014":["Control Module Input Power D Circuit/Open","Open circuit on input power line D of the control module (fourth supply rail). A communication loss with this module breaks any function relying on its data — diagnostic tools may show 'no response' and dependent modules can fall into limp mode.",[["h","Supply fuse blown"],["l","Gateway module routing CAN messages incorrectly"],["l","